(5924389, 864067, 40718, '<td valign="top">Hey! This guy is in Portland right?  I recognize him.</td>', 'Hey! This guy is in Portland right?  I recognize him.', '2010-04-01 01:07:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5924392, 864093, 15711, '<td valign="top">I like the idea.  A bit busy. Not crazy about being able to see the texture on the wall. Maybe pan back and show more of the reflection in the mirror.</td>', 'I like the idea.  A bit busy. Not crazy about being able to see the texture on the wall. Maybe pan back and show more of the reflection in the mirror.', '2010-04-01 01:07:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5924396, 863408, 15711, '<td valign="top">That''s lovely.  WOW - how on earth.  Must''ve been a heck of a windy evening. This is timeless.</td>', 'That''s lovely.  WOW - how on earth.  Must''ve been a heck of a windy evening. This is timeless.', '2010-04-01 01:08:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5924400, 863870, 15711, '<td valign="top">I love the BW conversion.  Terrific contrast and wide focus.  The texture of his feathers is great  -  almost like a pin and ink.  The composition is good.  Love the diagonal line connecting all of them together.  Is that fish to the left? turtles? other geese?  LOL  Doesn''t matter.  I love it.</td>', 'I love the BW conversion.  Terrific contrast and wide focus.  The texture of his feathers is great  -  almost like a pin and ink.  The composition is good.  Love the diagonal line connecting all of them together.  Is that fish to the left? turtles? other geese?  LOL  Doesn''t matter.  I love it.', '2010-04-01 01:09:57.000000', NULL, 1),
