(5924597, 863702, 66515, '<td valign="top">In my opinion (and that''s all it is) this feels like a snapshot that had Topaz liberally applied to it.</td>', 'In my opinion (and that''s all it is) this feels like a snapshot that had Topaz liberally applied to it.', '2010-04-01 02:14:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5924598, 864395, 30982, '<td valign="top">Lovely haze - moonlit?</td>', 'Lovely haze - moonlit?', '2010-04-01 02:14:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(5924599, 864217, 66515, '<td valign="top">I can''t quite remember the term (Tangential intersection seems to come to mind). Basically its when two objects "glob" on to each other due to their visually touching each other. In this case, the lady''s head is glued to the top of the frame.  To put it more simply: we need some space above her head.</td>', 'I can''t quite remember the term (Tangential intersection seems to come to mind). Basically its when two objects "glob" on to each other due to their visually touching each other. In this case, the lady''s head is glued to the top of the frame.  To put it more simply: we need some space above her head.', '2010-04-01 02:14:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(5924601, 863436, 30982, '<td valign="top">The toning works well for this in my opinion.  Make sure you use the full size available - this can be 800 pixels in width - much more effective that way.</td>', 'The toning works well for this in my opinion.  Make sure you use the full size available - this can be 800 pixels in width - much more effective that way.', '2010-04-01 02:15:08.000000', NULL, 1),
