(5924605, 864182, 66515, '<td valign="top">Beautiful scene but a tough one to capture. The fence in the foreground is quite underexposed unfortunately. I wonder how this would look if you went over the fence and got closer to the water and focused on the silhouetted trees and their reflections.</td>', 'Beautiful scene but a tough one to capture. The fence in the foreground is quite underexposed unfortunately. I wonder how this would look if you went over the fence and got closer to the water and focused on the silhouetted trees and their reflections.', '2010-04-01 02:15:37.000000', NULL, 1),
