(5925167, 864222, 100393, '<td valign="top">I''m going through the entries, stopping at those images I feel have had the benefit of an unconventional eye and dwelling a little longer to try to see and appreciate what you saw. This is one of those images. <br/> <br/>Positives: This is a really striking image - so full of interest that I''m sure you had a whole host of editing options / choices of look here. I think your chosen treatment works well enough but it is the scene itself and the POV that carries it.<br/> <br/>Critical stuff: Although the colour scheme works - I''m still not sure you''re getting the best out of this image; something that is in colour with a blue / green 70s kind of coloration with a vignette would probably have been my choice - but hey, it''s your choice and I do like it.<br/> <br/>Overall: Interesting work - one that keeps a viewer''s interest for a goodly while.</td>', 'I''m going through the entries, stopping at those images I feel have had the benefit of an unconventional eye and dwelling a little longer to try to see and appreciate what you saw. This is one of those images.  Positives: This is a really striking image - so full of interest that I''m sure you had a whole host of editing options / choices of look here. I think your chosen treatment works well enough but it is the scene itself and the POV that carries it. Critical stuff: Although the colour scheme works - I''m still not sure you''re getting the best out of this image; something that is in colour with a blue / green 70s kind of coloration with a vignette would probably have been my choice - but hey, it''s your choice and I do like it. Overall: Interesting work - one that keeps a viewer''s interest for a goodly while.', '2010-04-01 10:45:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5925170, 861548, 30049, '<td valign="top">Lighting seems a bit harsh on this.  Nice color, and it''s GREAT to be out from under all that snow, eh?  :-)</td>', 'Lighting seems a bit harsh on this.  Nice color, and it''s GREAT to be out from under all that snow, eh?  :-)', '2010-04-01 10:46:52.000000', NULL, 1),
