(5925221, 860177, 35545, '<td valign="top">This is a matter of personal taste, but I''d like it better if she didn''t have hair in her face.  Also, the grain is pretty heavy in her skin tones.</td>', 'This is a matter of personal taste, but I''d like it better if she didn''t have hair in her face.  Also, the grain is pretty heavy in her skin tones.', '2010-04-01 11:02:16.000000', NULL, 1),
