(5925226, 860181, 30049, '<td valign="top">Like the blue tones.  May have had more impact with a tighter crop (lose about 20% on the right and a smidge off the top and bottom).  JMO of course.  Good luck.</td>', 'Like the blue tones.  May have had more impact with a tighter crop (lose about 20% on the right and a smidge off the top and bottom).  JMO of course.  Good luck.', '2010-04-01 11:03:13.000000', NULL, 1),
