(5925228, 864196, 30861, '<td valign="top">"And deepen on Palmyra''s street<br/>The wheel rut in the ruined stone<br/>And Lebanon fade out and Crete<br/>High through the clouds and overblown<br/> <br/>And over Sicily the air<br/>Still flashing with the landward gulls<br/>And loom and slowly disappear<br/>The sails above the shadowy hulls..."<br/> <br/>"You, Andrew Marvell" by Archibald MacLeish  Google it!<br/> <br/>A lovely image!</td>', '"And deepen on Palmyra''s streetThe wheel rut in the ruined stoneAnd Lebanon fade out and CreteHigh through the clouds and overblown And over Sicily the airStill flashing with the landward gullsAnd loom and slowly disappearThe sails above the shadowy hulls..." "You, Andrew Marvell" by Archibald MacLeish  Google it! A lovely image!', '2010-04-01 11:03:58.000000', NULL, 1),
