(5925252, 862004, 4793, '<td valign="top">WOW, nice shot</td>', 'WOW, nice shot', '2010-04-01 11:10:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(5925253, 863195, 30049, '<td valign="top">Yep, it''s a snail alright.  Something about the presentation is bit ho-hummish for me.  Could be the split, slightly OOF green matter in the top right.  Sorry.  JMO.  Good luck.</td>', 'Yep, it''s a snail alright.  Something about the presentation is bit ho-hummish for me.  Could be the split, slightly OOF green matter in the top right.  Sorry.  JMO.  Good luck.', '2010-04-01 11:10:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5925254, 864248, 35545, '<td valign="top">IMNSHO, this would benefit from cropping a lot off the top and giving the shot a more landscape format.  There isn''t much of interest going on in the upper third of the shot, whereas that skull is killer.  I want to see more of it.</td>', 'IMNSHO, this would benefit from cropping a lot off the top and giving the shot a more landscape format.  There isn''t much of interest going on in the upper third of the shot, whereas that skull is killer.  I want to see more of it.', '2010-04-01 11:10:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5925255, 864244, 4793, '<td valign="top">Beautiful baby</td>', 'Beautiful baby', '2010-04-01 11:10:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5925257, 863366, 4793, '<td valign="top">Beautiful capture</td>', 'Beautiful capture', '2010-04-01 11:12:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5925258, 862927, 4793, '<td valign="top">Beautiful</td>', 'Beautiful', '2010-04-01 11:12:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5925260, 860873, 100393, '<td valign="top">I''m going through the entries, stopping at those images I feel have had the benefit of an unconventional eye and dwelling a little longer to try to see and appreciate what you saw. This is one of those images. <br/> <br/>Positives: Lovely smooth and subtle colour transitions are very nice here and capture the mood of the moment very well. I like the confidence you have had to let the the sun into your image on the right and the figures themselves draw the eye into the scene nicely.<br/> <br/>Critical stuff: I know the shore / bank doesn''t need to be horizontal but I think it does need rotating a little to get the men vertical. I''m not sure that the left hand side of the image is particularly strong.<br/> <br/>Overall, a very attractive and peaceful image - one that stands out to because of the way you have handled the light.</td>', 'I''m going through the entries, stopping at those images I feel have had the benefit of an unconventional eye and dwelling a little longer to try to see and appreciate what you saw. This is one of those images.  Positives: Lovely smooth and subtle colour transitions are very nice here and capture the mood of the moment very well. I like the confidence you have had to let the the sun into your image on the right and the figures themselves draw the eye into the scene nicely. Critical stuff: I know the shore / bank doesn''t need to be horizontal but I think it does need rotating a little to get the men vertical. I''m not sure that the left hand side of the image is particularly strong. Overall, a very attractive and peaceful image - one that stands out to because of the way you have handled the light.', '2010-04-01 11:12:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5925261, 864135, 4793, '<td valign="top">Cute shot</td>', 'Cute shot', '2010-04-01 11:13:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5925264, 864292, 4793, '<td valign="top">Beautiful colors and nice sharp details and pose</td>', 'Beautiful colors and nice sharp details and pose', '2010-04-01 11:14:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(5925265, 863889, 4793, '<td valign="top">WOW</td>', 'WOW', '2010-04-01 11:14:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5925266, 863932, 4793, '<td valign="top">Beautiful</td>', 'Beautiful', '2010-04-01 11:15:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5925270, 864172, 4793, '<td valign="top">Nice capture</td>', 'Nice capture', '2010-04-01 11:17:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5925271, 862926, 100393, '<td valign="top">I''m going through the entries, stopping at those images I feel have had the benefit of an unconventional eye and dwelling a little longer to try to see and appreciate what you saw. This is one of those images. <br/> <br/>Positives:Well, there is certainly plenty of documentary merit in this image and the way it is shot communicates a covert feel.<br/> <br/>Critical stuff: It looks like the man is offering a cigarette to this child - if that''s the case and I had my way, I happily see someone shoot him in the face. That''s how strongly I feel about it. However, back to your photo - it is difficult to be too critical, I interpret it as a shot from the hip with a camera phone - perhaps you couldn''t quite believe what you were seeing either.<br/> <br/>Overall: Good photograph? - No Powerful image? Yes.</td>', 'I''m going through the entries, stopping at those images I feel have had the benefit of an unconventional eye and dwelling a little longer to try to see and appreciate what you saw. This is one of those images.  Positives:Well, there is certainly plenty of documentary merit in this image and the way it is shot communicates a covert feel. Critical stuff: It looks like the man is offering a cigarette to this child - if that''s the case and I had my way, I happily see someone shoot him in the face. That''s how strongly I feel about it. However, back to your photo - it is difficult to be too critical, I interpret it as a shot from the hip with a camera phone - perhaps you couldn''t quite believe what you were seeing either. Overall: Good photograph? - No Powerful image? Yes.', '2010-04-01 11:18:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5925273, 864253, 4793, '<td valign="top">Very nice capture</td>', 'Very nice capture', '2010-04-01 11:18:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5925274, 864062, 4793, '<td valign="top">WOW</td>', 'WOW', '2010-04-01 11:18:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5925275, 864386, 4793, '<td valign="top">Nice capture</td>', 'Nice capture', '2010-04-01 11:19:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5925278, 864128, 4793, '<td valign="top">You needed to leave more space above this birds head,he is to cramped looking in the frame.</td>', 'You needed to leave more space above this birds head,he is to cramped looking in the frame.', '2010-04-01 11:21:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5925279, 864285, 4793, '<td valign="top">Nice shapes</td>', 'Nice shapes', '2010-04-01 11:21:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5925280, 864354, 100393, '<td valign="top">I''m going through the entries, stopping at those images I feel have had the benefit of an unconventional eye and dwelling a little longer to try to see and appreciate what you saw. This is one of those images. <br/> <br/>Positives: Great atmosphere you have captured here - none of the fun of the fair but I like it. The coloration works really well and I get a real sense of being there.<br/> <br/>Critical stuff: It looks just the tiniest bit dark to me, I think I would have raised the luminosity of the mid-tones just a tad.<br/> <br/>Overall: A very nice image. Crafted and effective.</td>', 'I''m going through the entries, stopping at those images I feel have had the benefit of an unconventional eye and dwelling a little longer to try to see and appreciate what you saw. This is one of those images.  Positives: Great atmosphere you have captured here - none of the fun of the fair but I like it. The coloration works really well and I get a real sense of being there. Critical stuff: It looks just the tiniest bit dark to me, I think I would have raised the luminosity of the mid-tones just a tad. Overall: A very nice image. Crafted and effective.', '2010-04-01 11:21:53.000000', NULL, 1),
