(5925987, 864099, 100393, '<td valign="top">I''m going through the entries, stopping at those images I feel have had the benefit of an unconventional eye and dwelling a little longer to try to see and appreciate what you saw. This is one of those images. <br/> <br/>Positives: Lovely coloration and I like how you have controlled the transparency of the various parts of the image.<br/> <br/>Critical stuff: It is very disorientating - I actually have to look away after about 5 seconds or I feel dizzy.<br/> <br/>Overall: Not quite as effective as it is unusual but interesting nonetheless.</td>', 'I''m going through the entries, stopping at those images I feel have had the benefit of an unconventional eye and dwelling a little longer to try to see and appreciate what you saw. This is one of those images.  Positives: Lovely coloration and I like how you have controlled the transparency of the various parts of the image. Critical stuff: It is very disorientating - I actually have to look away after about 5 seconds or I feel dizzy. Overall: Not quite as effective as it is unusual but interesting nonetheless.', '2010-04-01 17:28:59.000000', NULL, 1),
