(5925997, 864402, 74911, '<td valign="top">Great work on the star trails... very successful in your attempt...</td>', 'Great work on the star trails... very successful in your attempt...', '2010-04-01 17:31:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5926000, 864289, 100393, '<td valign="top">I''m going through the entries, stopping at those images I feel have had the benefit of an unconventional eye and dwelling a little longer to try to see and appreciate what you saw. This is one of those images. <br/> <br/>Positives: Great moody image - bring your own story stuff. I really like the POV and the use of the straight lines.<br/> <br/>Critical stuff: I''m not a fan of your conversion, I think a stronger contrast treatment might have been better - the grain too, enough to annoy but not enough to delight.<br/> <br/>Overall: I really like the idea but I''m not sure this is an optimal edit.</td>', 'I''m going through the entries, stopping at those images I feel have had the benefit of an unconventional eye and dwelling a little longer to try to see and appreciate what you saw. This is one of those images.  Positives: Great moody image - bring your own story stuff. I really like the POV and the use of the straight lines. Critical stuff: I''m not a fan of your conversion, I think a stronger contrast treatment might have been better - the grain too, enough to annoy but not enough to delight. Overall: I really like the idea but I''m not sure this is an optimal edit.', '2010-04-01 17:32:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5926003, 862307, 100393, '<td valign="top">I''m going through the entries, stopping at those images I feel have had the benefit of an unconventional eye and dwelling a little longer to try to see and appreciate what you saw. This is one of those images. <br/> <br/>Positives: Love this! I''m not sure you can go wrong with a close-up cow. Great colours too. The POV makes the image and although the DOF is limited I think it still works.<br/> <br/>Critical stuff: Not much - a bit of chromatic aberration in places and yes on reflection I would have like to have seen a bit more depth of field.<br/> <br/>Overall: Great image - loads of fun.</td>', 'I''m going through the entries, stopping at those images I feel have had the benefit of an unconventional eye and dwelling a little longer to try to see and appreciate what you saw. This is one of those images.  Positives: Love this! I''m not sure you can go wrong with a close-up cow. Great colours too. The POV makes the image and although the DOF is limited I think it still works. Critical stuff: Not much - a bit of chromatic aberration in places and yes on reflection I would have like to have seen a bit more depth of field. Overall: Great image - loads of fun.', '2010-04-01 17:36:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5926004, 861576, 100393, '<td valign="top">Spectacular!</td>', 'Spectacular!', '2010-04-01 17:37:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5926046, 863200, 3102, '<td valign="top">Beautiful girl... looks just a bit over-edited, though.  The skin looks like it has been edited to the point that it''s blurred.</td>', 'Beautiful girl... looks just a bit over-edited, though.  The skin looks like it has been edited to the point that it''s blurred.', '2010-04-01 18:03:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5926061, 863441, 100393, '<td valign="top">I''m going through the entries, stopping at those images I feel have had the benefit of an unconventional eye and dwelling a little longer to try to see and appreciate what you saw. This is one of those images. <br/> <br/>Positives: Beautiful composition and coloration. Lovely light too. Very pretty image indeed.<br/> <br/>I really like the vignette effect too.<br/> <br/>Critical stuff: I''d like it to be a bit bigger - I think you could have lost a little bit from the left side to give more area within the 800px limit.<br/> <br/>Overall: Great stuff.</td>', 'I''m going through the entries, stopping at those images I feel have had the benefit of an unconventional eye and dwelling a little longer to try to see and appreciate what you saw. This is one of those images.  Positives: Beautiful composition and coloration. Lovely light too. Very pretty image indeed. I really like the vignette effect too. Critical stuff: I''d like it to be a bit bigger - I think you could have lost a little bit from the left side to give more area within the 800px limit. Overall: Great stuff.', '2010-04-01 18:14:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5926075, 864365, 100393, '<td valign="top">Funny, a bit bizarre, but actually pretty well executed too.</td>', 'Funny, a bit bizarre, but actually pretty well executed too.', '2010-04-01 18:20:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5926102, 864385, 100393, '<td valign="top">I''m going through the entries, stopping at those images I feel have had the benefit of an unconventional eye and dwelling a little longer to try to see and appreciate what you saw. This is one of those images. <br/> <br/>Positives: Stand-out post processing (a Nik filter?). The tilt works really well too. The main subject is compelling enough but for me the scene / environment is the star here.<br/> <br/>Critical stuff: Not much at all.<br/> <br/>Overall: An interesting and successful image.</td>', 'I''m going through the entries, stopping at those images I feel have had the benefit of an unconventional eye and dwelling a little longer to try to see and appreciate what you saw. This is one of those images.  Positives: Stand-out post processing (a Nik filter?). The tilt works really well too. The main subject is compelling enough but for me the scene / environment is the star here. Critical stuff: Not much at all. Overall: An interesting and successful image.', '2010-04-01 18:33:26.000000', NULL, 1),
