(5926150, 864247, 100393, '<td valign="top">I''m going through the entries, stopping at those images I feel have had the benefit of an unconventional eye and dwelling a little longer to try to see and appreciate what you saw. This is one of those images. <br/> <br/>Positives: Nice use of perspective and I appreciate the nested symmetry. I can see that you have crafted an image from very little really.<br/> <br/>Critical stuff: Although I can appreciate your photography here, I think the scene itself hasn''t helped you much.<br/> <br/>Overall: A good attempt at dressing up a fairly dull scene - there is probably more of the photographer''s hand here than in many images.</td>', 'I''m going through the entries, stopping at those images I feel have had the benefit of an unconventional eye and dwelling a little longer to try to see and appreciate what you saw. This is one of those images.  Positives: Nice use of perspective and I appreciate the nested symmetry. I can see that you have crafted an image from very little really. Critical stuff: Although I can appreciate your photography here, I think the scene itself hasn''t helped you much. Overall: A good attempt at dressing up a fairly dull scene - there is probably more of the photographer''s hand here than in many images.', '2010-04-01 18:56:20.000000', NULL, 1),
