(5926715, 860757, 30049, '<td valign="top">An interesting looking place for sure.  As for the photo, I think you may have picked the wrong time of day for this as the lighting is a bit harsh and the washed out sky isn''t contributing in a positive manner.  I can understand your desire to show the reflections, but the image ends up nearly centered with this comp.  I''d consider taking a smidge off the bottom.  All JMO of course.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'An interesting looking place for sure.  As for the photo, I think you may have picked the wrong time of day for this as the lighting is a bit harsh and the washed out sky isn''t contributing in a positive manner.  I can understand your desire to show the reflections, but the image ends up nearly centered with this comp.  I''d consider taking a smidge off the bottom.  All JMO of course.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2010-04-01 23:28:01.000000', NULL, 1),
