(5927014, 864199, 100393, '<td valign="top">St John''s?<br/> <br/>It is a nice image but it seems ever so slightly over-sharpened to me.</td>', 'St John''s? It is a nice image but it seems ever so slightly over-sharpened to me.', '2010-04-02 07:07:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5927017, 864407, 100393, '<td valign="top">I''m going through the entries, stopping at those images I feel have had the benefit of an unconventional eye and dwelling a little longer to try to see and appreciate what you saw. This is one of those images. <br/> <br/>Positives: I like the repeating geometric pattern and the angle of rotation of the lines relative to the frame.<br/> <br/>Critical stuff: Too dark really and a little bit blurry too.<br/> <br/>Overall: I like the vision but I''m not so keen on the result.</td>', 'I''m going through the entries, stopping at those images I feel have had the benefit of an unconventional eye and dwelling a little longer to try to see and appreciate what you saw. This is one of those images.  Positives: I like the repeating geometric pattern and the angle of rotation of the lines relative to the frame. Critical stuff: Too dark really and a little bit blurry too. Overall: I like the vision but I''m not so keen on the result.', '2010-04-02 07:11:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5927018, 864263, 76712, '<td valign="top">WOW</td>', 'WOW', '2010-04-02 07:13:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5927019, 860329, 76712, '<td valign="top">Woow this is nice, beautiful golden feflection</td>', 'Woow this is nice, beautiful golden feflection', '2010-04-02 07:13:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5927020, 863817, 100393, '<td valign="top">I''m going through the entries, stopping at those images I feel have had the benefit of an unconventional eye and dwelling a little longer to try to see and appreciate what you saw. This is one of those images. <br/> <br/>Positives: Very nice work - the image conveys a sense of photographic control - a real sense of active framing here, like you have placed the horizon ''just so'' in the frame. I like the coloration / toning too - just a hint of bronze.<br/> <br/>Critical stuff: The overall interest in the scene is intrinsically low so I''m not sure you had too much to work with.<br/> <br/>Overall: A nice minimalist landscape.</td>', 'I''m going through the entries, stopping at those images I feel have had the benefit of an unconventional eye and dwelling a little longer to try to see and appreciate what you saw. This is one of those images.  Positives: Very nice work - the image conveys a sense of photographic control - a real sense of active framing here, like you have placed the horizon ''just so'' in the frame. I like the coloration / toning too - just a hint of bronze. Critical stuff: The overall interest in the scene is intrinsically low so I''m not sure you had too much to work with. Overall: A nice minimalist landscape.', '2010-04-02 07:16:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5927021, 860872, 76712, '<td valign="top">like the minimalism, and the leading line aha very nice</td>', 'like the minimalism, and the leading line aha very nice', '2010-04-02 07:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(5927022, 862693, 76712, '<td valign="top">i wonder who took this....:) brilliant as usual</td>', 'i wonder who took this....:) brilliant as usual', '2010-04-02 07:19:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5927024, 860872, 100393, '<td valign="top">I''m going through the entries, stopping at those images I feel have had the benefit of an unconventional eye and dwelling a little longer to try to see and appreciate what you saw. This is one of those images. <br/> <br/>Positives: Nice find / set up. Great use of primary colours and a brave (but absolutely appropriate) crop.<br/> <br/>Critical stuff: Not too much - the grass looks a little over-sharpened.<br/> <br/>Overall: A charming image.</td>', 'I''m going through the entries, stopping at those images I feel have had the benefit of an unconventional eye and dwelling a little longer to try to see and appreciate what you saw. This is one of those images.  Positives: Nice find / set up. Great use of primary colours and a brave (but absolutely appropriate) crop. Critical stuff: Not too much - the grass looks a little over-sharpened. Overall: A charming image.', '2010-04-02 07:20:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5927026, 861323, 100393, '<td valign="top">I''m going through the entries, stopping at those images I feel have had the benefit of an unconventional eye and dwelling a little longer to try to see and appreciate what you saw. This is one of those images. <br/> <br/>Positives: I really like this - The metallic colour palette is really nice, particularly the side sections. The architecture, the geometry, the reflected scene all add interest - I think the selective desaturation works too - it serves to emphasise the most interesting (colour) sections of you image.<br/> <br/>Critical stuff: Nothing at all.<br/> <br/>Overall: A very successful image - I like that we can see ample evidence of photographic choices you made.</td>', 'I''m going through the entries, stopping at those images I feel have had the benefit of an unconventional eye and dwelling a little longer to try to see and appreciate what you saw. This is one of those images.  Positives: I really like this - The metallic colour palette is really nice, particularly the side sections. The architecture, the geometry, the reflected scene all add interest - I think the selective desaturation works too - it serves to emphasise the most interesting (colour) sections of you image. Critical stuff: Nothing at all. Overall: A very successful image - I like that we can see ample evidence of photographic choices you made.', '2010-04-02 07:25:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5927036, 863543, 40391, '<td valign="top">The eye looks so sad. Very nice photo and the b&amp;w works well. Something funny is happening around the mouth (on my laptop monitor) that may have been the result of some post processing. Good luck.</td>', 'The eye looks so sad. Very nice photo and the b&w works well. Something funny is happening around the mouth (on my laptop monitor) that may have been the result of some post processing. Good luck.', '2010-04-02 07:37:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5927038, 863791, 20130, '<td valign="top">a great well focused capture</td>', 'a great well focused capture', '2010-04-02 07:41:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5927041, 863302, 57447, '<td valign="top">Great composition, play ball!</td>', 'Great composition, play ball!', '2010-04-02 07:43:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5927044, 864135, 20130, '<td valign="top">great emotion and tones .. a tighter crop  imo would be better but a good photo anyway</td>', 'great emotion and tones .. a tighter crop  imo would be better but a good photo anyway', '2010-04-02 07:49:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5927045, 863893, 20130, '<td valign="top">good clarity not sure about the negative space but still a striking photo  though</td>', 'good clarity not sure about the negative space but still a striking photo  though', '2010-04-02 07:51:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5927046, 860255, 20130, '<td valign="top">nice processing and tones</td>', 'nice processing and tones', '2010-04-02 07:52:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5927049, 863300, 20130, '<td valign="top">a great action shot good detail</td>', 'a great action shot good detail', '2010-04-02 07:54:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5927050, 861947, 103142, '<td valign="top">I wasn''t sure when this first came up. I think maybe it seemed a tad washed out. Yet the more I look at it, more contrast would be the wrong thing. However, I really like the grain in this shot -- it adds quite a bit to the photo. It was a 6 in initial reaction and quickly grew to an 8 as I continued to ponder it. Here''s to hoping that everyone takes the time to ponder it!</td>', 'I wasn''t sure when this first came up. I think maybe it seemed a tad washed out. Yet the more I look at it, more contrast would be the wrong thing. However, I really like the grain in this shot -- it adds quite a bit to the photo. It was a 6 in initial reaction and quickly grew to an 8 as I continued to ponder it. Here''s to hoping that everyone takes the time to ponder it!', '2010-04-02 07:55:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5927051, 864396, 20130, '<td valign="top">good bokeh and sharp details</td>', 'good bokeh and sharp details', '2010-04-02 07:56:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5927053, 863993, 20130, '<td valign="top">nice tones</td>', 'nice tones', '2010-04-02 07:57:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5927054, 864199, 103142, '<td valign="top">Lovely shot and nicely done. I''m curious what it would have looked like if you cropped out the left side. The boat on the right is so superior to the boat on the left, and the bridge and the building are so much more interesting than the tree, that I wonder if cropped out the left, leaving the right boat at the left 1/3 line might strength it even more.  -7-</td>', 'Lovely shot and nicely done. I''m curious what it would have looked like if you cropped out the left side. The boat on the right is so superior to the boat on the left, and the bridge and the building are so much more interesting than the tree, that I wonder if cropped out the left, leaving the right boat at the left 1/3 line might strength it even more.  -7-', '2010-04-02 08:00:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(5927055, 862693, 20130, '<td valign="top">great close up plenty of detail and perfect tones make this pop</td>', 'great close up plenty of detail and perfect tones make this pop', '2010-04-02 08:00:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5927057, 861990, 103142, '<td valign="top">Wow! Really cool photo! Clever idea. I do think that the white line going across is quite distracting, though. It would have been much stronger if you could have cloned it out or darkened it somehow so that it wasn''t so obvious. -7- (8 or possibly 9 without the line)</td>', 'Wow! Really cool photo! Clever idea. I do think that the white line going across is quite distracting, though. It would have been much stronger if you could have cloned it out or darkened it somehow so that it wasn''t so obvious. -7- (8 or possibly 9 without the line)', '2010-04-02 08:02:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5927058, 864402, 20130, '<td valign="top">good composition great star trails</td>', 'good composition great star trails', '2010-04-02 08:02:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5927059, 864251, 20130, '<td valign="top">nice soft image</td>', 'nice soft image', '2010-04-02 08:03:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5927060, 864267, 20130, '<td valign="top">you have created a nice mood here</td>', 'you have created a nice mood here', '2010-04-02 08:03:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5927061, 864253, 103142, '<td valign="top">Sweet photo. Great intensity. Very small thing -- I would have liked it shifted over to the right just a tad. The back isn''t as interesting, it would have given the dog more space to look out. It''s not quite centered, it''s not rule of thirds, at it doesn''t have to be, but it feels just a little lopsided. (I hope that makes sense. It doesn''t make any difference in my vote -- it was a small thing that would make the composition feel a little better, imho...) -7-</td>', 'Sweet photo. Great intensity. Very small thing -- I would have liked it shifted over to the right just a tad. The back isn''t as interesting, it would have given the dog more space to look out. It''s not quite centered, it''s not rule of thirds, at it doesn''t have to be, but it feels just a little lopsided. (I hope that makes sense. It doesn''t make any difference in my vote -- it was a small thing that would make the composition feel a little better, imho...) -7-', '2010-04-02 08:05:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(5927062, 864241, 40391, '<td valign="top">Excellent focus and DoF.  The very narrow band of focus - was this achieved with large aperture lens or through PP? Either way its very well done. Good luck</td>', 'Excellent focus and DoF.  The very narrow band of focus - was this achieved with large aperture lens or through PP? Either way its very well done. Good luck', '2010-04-02 08:05:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5927065, 864197, 20130, '<td valign="top">great capture  really like the sky tones and the contrasting soft water</td>', 'great capture  really like the sky tones and the contrasting soft water', '2010-04-02 08:08:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(5927066, 863419, 20130, '<td valign="top">my fave so far great in all respects wish you well for a ribbon</td>', 'my fave so far great in all respects wish you well for a ribbon', '2010-04-02 08:09:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5927070, 861980, 20130, '<td valign="top">a great shot i like the backgound as well</td>', 'a great shot i like the backgound as well', '2010-04-02 08:14:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5927071, 863751, 73942, '<td valign="top">beautiful lighting, very nice portrait</td>', 'beautiful lighting, very nice portrait', '2010-04-02 08:15:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5927072, 864289, 73942, '<td valign="top">nice use of lights and lines, good eye</td>', 'nice use of lights and lines, good eye', '2010-04-02 08:16:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5927073, 864389, 20130, '<td valign="top">great processing and tones well titled</td>', 'great processing and tones well titled', '2010-04-02 08:16:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(5927074, 863983, 73942, '<td valign="top">a fun and sexy portrait at the same time, I like the high key approach</td>', 'a fun and sexy portrait at the same time, I like the high key approach', '2010-04-02 08:17:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5927075, 861536, 20130, '<td valign="top">good pov and suits b/w treatment</td>', 'good pov and suits b/w treatment', '2010-04-02 08:17:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5927077, 864170, 73942, '<td valign="top">I would imagine you''re going to get negative comments about the border and dark circle, but I like what it adds, it enhances the light coming in from the left side, there is a beauty to this</td>', 'I would imagine you''re going to get negative comments about the border and dark circle, but I like what it adds, it enhances the light coming in from the left side, there is a beauty to this', '2010-04-02 08:18:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5927079, 863920, 73942, '<td valign="top">not sure I''ve ever seen a nighttime photograph of a coliseum, this is interesting, wonder what it would look like in B&amp;W or sepia</td>', 'not sure I''ve ever seen a nighttime photograph of a coliseum, this is interesting, wonder what it would look like in B&W or sepia', '2010-04-02 08:20:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5927083, 863302, 73942, '<td valign="top">I like how you took this at an angle, adds to the interest</td>', 'I like how you took this at an angle, adds to the interest', '2010-04-02 08:37:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(5927084, 862927, 73942, '<td valign="top">wonderful macro with such great detail</td>', 'wonderful macro with such great detail', '2010-04-02 08:38:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5927085, 864241, 73942, '<td valign="top">wow, excellent macro, wonderful capture</td>', 'wow, excellent macro, wonderful capture', '2010-04-02 08:39:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5927090, 864047, 96881, '<td valign="top">A brilliant capture of the bird......sharp and really well done.<br/>For composition, I would have included more sky to the right, giving the bird an area to ''fly'' into, placing the bird on the left line of thirds and balancing this image.  That would have boosted the score even higher.</td>', 'A brilliant capture of the bird......sharp and really well done.For composition, I would have included more sky to the right, giving the bird an area to ''fly'' into, placing the bird on the left line of thirds and balancing this image.  That would have boosted the score even higher.', '2010-04-02 08:46:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5927091, 864022, 96881, '<td valign="top">Very different, colours are good through this, and the centered composition seems to work for this</td>', 'Very different, colours are good through this, and the centered composition seems to work for this', '2010-04-02 08:48:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5927092, 863423, 96881, '<td valign="top">Unfortunately the bird body is not sharp.  A great attempt with the shallow depth of field to remove the distracting elements in the background.</td>', 'Unfortunately the bird body is not sharp.  A great attempt with the shallow depth of field to remove the distracting elements in the background.', '2010-04-02 08:50:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5927093, 864407, 96881, '<td valign="top">Very interesting shapes and lines throughout this image. The rotation works well as the cropping of the shapes and the diagonal lines through the image are really good.</td>', 'Very interesting shapes and lines throughout this image. The rotation works well as the cropping of the shapes and the diagonal lines through the image are really good.', '2010-04-02 08:51:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5927094, 861546, 114225, '<td valign="top">Nice morning or evening lighting. I like how the sun is glinting off the tops of the balls.</td>', 'Nice morning or evening lighting. I like how the sun is glinting off the tops of the balls.', '2010-04-02 08:52:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5927095, 864241, 96881, '<td valign="top">Nice composition and narrow depth of field through this image.</td>', 'Nice composition and narrow depth of field through this image.', '2010-04-02 08:53:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5927096, 859502, 114225, '<td valign="top">Very dramatic sky. Good composition.</td>', 'Very dramatic sky. Good composition.', '2010-04-02 08:53:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5927097, 864293, 96881, '<td valign="top">Those eyes really do stand out here.......nicely done.</td>', 'Those eyes really do stand out here.......nicely done.', '2010-04-02 08:53:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5927099, 863827, 114225, '<td valign="top">Nicely framed. I think I would have gone a point higher if you took the photo at a different time of day. Either morning or evening to get the warmer light.</td>', 'Nicely framed. I think I would have gone a point higher if you took the photo at a different time of day. Either morning or evening to get the warmer light.', '2010-04-02 08:54:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(5927100, 860872, 114225, '<td valign="top">Nicely composed. I don''t know if the plan trail adds or subtracts from the image, but it didn''t change how I voted.</td>', 'Nicely composed. I don''t know if the plan trail adds or subtracts from the image, but it didn''t change how I voted.', '2010-04-02 08:55:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5927105, 864293, 114225, '<td valign="top">She looks a bit unnatural with her arm in the position.</td>', 'She looks a bit unnatural with her arm in the position.', '2010-04-02 09:00:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5927106, 861546, 96881, '<td valign="top">Not really sure about the composition here, the white ball is the one that draws my attention yet it is places behind on of the red balls.  I would have probably used selective desat on the grass.  Just keeping the red of the balls would have given a really striking effect here. The grass is patchy and partly dead, and also distracting by the uneven textures</td>', 'Not really sure about the composition here, the white ball is the one that draws my attention yet it is places behind on of the red balls.  I would have probably used selective desat on the grass.  Just keeping the red of the balls would have given a really striking effect here. The grass is patchy and partly dead, and also distracting by the uneven textures', '2010-04-02 09:00:47.000000', NULL, 1),
