(5927497, 860828, 96881, '<td valign="top">Nice Subtle colours in this make it a good image.  The centred composition though is a little of a negative.  I would have loved a wider view, with more of the pathway leading to the lighthouse (if possible) giving this a landscape view.  The couple on the headland is a nice touch, as it the two birds.  The border does balance it all nicely as well.....</td>', 'Nice Subtle colours in this make it a good image.  The centred composition though is a little of a negative.  I would have loved a wider view, with more of the pathway leading to the lighthouse (if possible) giving this a landscape view.  The couple on the headland is a nice touch, as it the two birds.  The border does balance it all nicely as well.....', '2010-04-02 14:30:08.000000', NULL, 1),
