(5927899, 864399, 105130, '<td valign="top">Really interesting and so much to look at. I love your bold but confident B&amp;W conversion. I wish the moon was more of a feature though.</td>', 'Really interesting and so much to look at. I love your bold but confident B&W conversion. I wish the moon was more of a feature though.', '2010-04-02 18:40:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5927902, 864172, 105130, '<td valign="top">Stunning, almost up there with an Alex Saberi photo. Perhaps the vignetting is a touch too heavy, but that''s about my only complaint.</td>', 'Stunning, almost up there with an Alex Saberi photo. Perhaps the vignetting is a touch too heavy, but that''s about my only complaint.', '2010-04-02 18:43:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5927903, 864067, 105130, '<td valign="top">You say street, but I see park (unless I look in the reflection of his glasses). I don''t know, it just seems a little . . . awkward.</td>', 'You say street, but I see park (unless I look in the reflection of his glasses). I don''t know, it just seems a little . . . awkward.', '2010-04-02 18:44:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5927905, 863705, 105130, '<td valign="top">This looks quite <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=5112" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">ursula</a>-esque, although I''m almost sure it''s not her. So please take that as a compliment. :-)</td>', 'This looks quite  ursula-esque, although I''m almost sure it''s not her. So please take that as a compliment. :-)', '2010-04-02 18:47:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5927908, 863308, 105130, '<td valign="top">Nope, sorry, not working for me. Too little squirrel, too much . . . other stuff.</td>', 'Nope, sorry, not working for me. Too little squirrel, too much . . . other stuff.', '2010-04-02 18:47:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5927909, 863441, 105130, '<td valign="top">Great scenery and a deft exposure on the sky, but there just seems to be a general yellow cast to the photo that could have been fixed very easily.</td>', 'Great scenery and a deft exposure on the sky, but there just seems to be a general yellow cast to the photo that could have been fixed very easily.', '2010-04-02 18:48:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(5927910, 864140, 105130, '<td valign="top">Lovely deep blue sky and nice positioning of the lighthouse. I feel you could have cropped out about half of the beach, and your horizon looks crooked (I know, the lighthouse is straight though!).</td>', 'Lovely deep blue sky and nice positioning of the lighthouse. I feel you could have cropped out about half of the beach, and your horizon looks crooked (I know, the lighthouse is straight though!).', '2010-04-02 18:50:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5927912, 864291, 73942, '<td valign="top">interesting framing, it works well here, the only thing that bothers me a little about this image is her stare, it''s not like she''s looking at something but rather disengaged, if you know what I mean, hmm wish I could give you a better explanation, still a good image - 7</td>', 'interesting framing, it works well here, the only thing that bothers me a little about this image is her stare, it''s not like she''s looking at something but rather disengaged, if you know what I mean, hmm wish I could give you a better explanation, still a good image - 7', '2010-04-02 18:52:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5927914, 864172, 73942, '<td valign="top">looks like he''s laughing at you, you''ve got some nice detail in this shot</td>', 'looks like he''s laughing at you, you''ve got some nice detail in this shot', '2010-04-02 18:52:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5927915, 864246, 105130, '<td valign="top">Dark, gritty and grainy, and very well done. I think it''s great. Is the poor thing floating? My only gripe is that black spot on the right hand side - I''d have been sorely tempted to have cloned it out.</td>', 'Dark, gritty and grainy, and very well done. I think it''s great. Is the poor thing floating? My only gripe is that black spot on the right hand side - I''d have been sorely tempted to have cloned it out.', '2010-04-02 18:53:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5927916, 864281, 73942, '<td valign="top">beautiful, has the feel of a painting</td>', 'beautiful, has the feel of a painting', '2010-04-02 18:53:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5927917, 864254, 115135, '<td valign="top">Frábær mynd</td>', 'Frábær mynd', '2010-04-02 18:53:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(5927918, 864354, 105130, '<td valign="top">I like this image very much, the processing has been done wonderfully. That white stripe in the bottom middle bugs the hell out of me though!</td>', 'I like this image very much, the processing has been done wonderfully. That white stripe in the bottom middle bugs the hell out of me though!', '2010-04-02 18:54:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5927927, 864139, 103142, '<td valign="top">I adore pelicans, and it''s a wonderful shot as well!</td>', 'I adore pelicans, and it''s a wonderful shot as well!', '2010-04-02 19:05:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(5927928, 860873, 65234, '<td valign="top">Interesting image.  Between the tilted horizon and the light and mist on the right it looks like a progression into heaven.</td>', 'Interesting image.  Between the tilted horizon and the light and mist on the right it looks like a progression into heaven.', '2010-04-02 19:11:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5927929, 863577, 65234, '<td valign="top">Cute.  Looks like it should be an ad for something.</td>', 'Cute.  Looks like it should be an ad for something.', '2010-04-02 19:12:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5927930, 863419, 65234, '<td valign="top">I don''t think he appreciated the interruption to his meal ;-)  Either that or he was afraid you wanted it for yourself.<br/> <br/>Nice detail here.</td>', 'I don''t think he appreciated the interruption to his meal ;-)  Either that or he was afraid you wanted it for yourself. Nice detail here.', '2010-04-02 19:15:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5927931, 864256, 65234, '<td valign="top">Almost cute enough to give him one!  Like the DOF and composition a lot.</td>', 'Almost cute enough to give him one!  Like the DOF and composition a lot.', '2010-04-02 19:15:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5927934, 860240, 65234, '<td valign="top">Oooh, nice swirly patterns they''re making, and they crisscross besides.  Weel seen.</td>', 'Oooh, nice swirly patterns they''re making, and they crisscross besides.  Weel seen.', '2010-04-02 19:16:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5927935, 864253, 65234, '<td valign="top">Great expression and very nice detail.  A lovely portrait.</td>', 'Great expression and very nice detail.  A lovely portrait.', '2010-04-02 19:19:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5927937, 863282, 65234, '<td valign="top">That smile is positively contagious!</td>', 'That smile is positively contagious!', '2010-04-02 19:19:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5927939, 863941, 65234, '<td valign="top">Dramatic scene that doesn''t quite fulfill it''s potential IMO.  Could use a contrast boost, at least, since the light is rather flat looking.</td>', 'Dramatic scene that doesn''t quite fulfill it''s potential IMO.  Could use a contrast boost, at least, since the light is rather flat looking.', '2010-04-02 19:21:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5927941, 864395, 65234, '<td valign="top">Lovely light and detail.</td>', 'Lovely light and detail.', '2010-04-02 19:21:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5927951, 861741, 65234, '<td valign="top">Turtles amuse me when they''re basking like this.  Looks a bit oversaturated on my screen.  I''m not wild about the composition ... but then centered subjects don''t often appeal to me.  It''s actually kind of fun to convert it to B&amp;W and flip it so the turtles are facing skywards.  Not realistic, but fun ;-)</td>', 'Turtles amuse me when they''re basking like this.  Looks a bit oversaturated on my screen.  I''m not wild about the composition ... but then centered subjects don''t often appeal to me.  It''s actually kind of fun to convert it to B&W and flip it so the turtles are facing skywards.  Not realistic, but fun ;-)', '2010-04-02 19:29:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5927952, 864129, 65234, '<td valign="top">That bird better be fast!  It''s nothing more than a bite-sized appetizer.</td>', 'That bird better be fast!  It''s nothing more than a bite-sized appetizer.', '2010-04-02 19:30:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5927956, 863636, 65234, '<td valign="top">She looks like a little doll.  Almost in a Stepford-perfect way.</td>', 'She looks like a little doll.  Almost in a Stepford-perfect way.', '2010-04-02 19:33:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5927957, 861980, 65234, '<td valign="top">Oh, how pretty!  Like lots of little fairy lights.</td>', 'Oh, how pretty!  Like lots of little fairy lights.', '2010-04-02 19:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(5927959, 861436, 18367, '<td valign="top">Et Une très jolie gitane.<br/> <br/>Nice depth of field, good focus and I particularly like that negative space to her right...it gives one the impression that she is still longing for whatever it is she left behind.<br/> <br/>Very nicely done indeed.  I do wish you the best of luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Et Une très jolie gitane. Nice depth of field, good focus and I particularly like that negative space to her right...it gives one the impression that she is still longing for whatever it is she left behind. Very nicely done indeed.  I do wish you the best of luck in the challenge.', '2010-04-02 19:36:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5927961, 859740, 65234, '<td valign="top">Oka-a-a-y, I can do that.  Is it going to do something special if I watch long enough?<br/> <br/>This gets funnier the longer I look at it ;-)</td>', 'Oka-a-a-y, I can do that.  Is it going to do something special if I watch long enough? This gets funnier the longer I look at it ;-)', '2010-04-02 19:37:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5927962, 861576, 18367, '<td valign="top">Fantastic capture.  I do hope you share the particulars of this image...it is truly something to behold.</td>', 'Fantastic capture.  I do hope you share the particulars of this image...it is truly something to behold.', '2010-04-02 19:38:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5927963, 864037, 65234, '<td valign="top">Nice perspective to get that slight angle on the repeating benches and trees.</td>', 'Nice perspective to get that slight angle on the repeating benches and trees.', '2010-04-02 19:38:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5927964, 862693, 65234, '<td valign="top">Great macro bug!</td>', 'Great macro bug!', '2010-04-02 19:38:38.000000', NULL, 1),
