(5928004, 863814, 75585, '<td valign="top">I woud have liked this even more if it had been a vertical panorama format to highlight the giraffe''s most notable feature - it''s long long neck.</td>', 'I woud have liked this even more if it had been a vertical panorama format to highlight the giraffe''s most notable feature - it''s long long neck.', '2010-04-02 20:21:37.000000', NULL, 1),
