(5928013, 862926, 37845, '<td valign="top">I would hope that this photo is journalistic in its intent, and to show what is happening, and not an attempt to glorify what the adult male in this shot is doing. What he is doing is child abuse.</td>', 'I would hope that this photo is journalistic in its intent, and to show what is happening, and not an attempt to glorify what the adult male in this shot is doing. What he is doing is child abuse.', '2010-04-02 20:36:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5928015, 863506, 94239, '<td valign="top">Melancholy inducing portrait.  And now I''m going to be hearing that song all day.</td>', 'Melancholy inducing portrait.  And now I''m going to be hearing that song all day.', '2010-04-02 20:36:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5928016, 864178, 75585, '<td valign="top">I like this but I don''t understand the cinnamon sticks with and the cloth towel?  I think a white plate would have been more appropo.  Didn''t affect my vote though.</td>', 'I like this but I don''t understand the cinnamon sticks with and the cloth towel?  I think a white plate would have been more appropo.  Didn''t affect my vote though.', '2010-04-02 20:38:08.000000', NULL, 1),
