(5928020, 864244, 75585, '<td valign="top">Looks a bit too smoothed (especially the hair).  Still a very cute photo!  I can see strokes above the baby where it looks like perhaps you were dodging the background more white?</td>', 'Looks a bit too smoothed (especially the hair).  Still a very cute photo!  I can see strokes above the baby where it looks like perhaps you were dodging the background more white?', '2010-04-02 20:40:31.000000', NULL, 1),
