(5931396, 864269, 100393, '<td valign="top">I''m going through the entries, stopping at those images I feel have had the benefit of an unconventional eye and dwelling a little longer to try to see and appreciate what you saw. This is one of those images. <br/> <br/>Positives: Great effect - looks like an intricate mosaic. I really like how we can find sharpness and blur in this image and how those elements are intermixed across the whole frame. The trees themselves offer a great primer for the image - we see the trees but the way the branches act to fragment the image is very effective.<br/> <br/>Critical stuff: The dark band at the top of the image - this area doesn''t really add much and actually detracts a little from the effect you have created.<br/> <br/>Overall: Very effective image.</td>', 'I''m going through the entries, stopping at those images I feel have had the benefit of an unconventional eye and dwelling a little longer to try to see and appreciate what you saw. This is one of those images.  Positives: Great effect - looks like an intricate mosaic. I really like how we can find sharpness and blur in this image and how those elements are intermixed across the whole frame. The trees themselves offer a great primer for the image - we see the trees but the way the branches act to fragment the image is very effective. Critical stuff: The dark band at the top of the image - this area doesn''t really add much and actually detracts a little from the effect you have created. Overall: Very effective image.', '2010-04-05 09:35:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5931429, 863436, 30049, '<td valign="top">I like the scene and the choice of color tone works well.  Seems just a tad washed out, like it could use a little more contrast.  ???  Just a thought.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'I like the scene and the choice of color tone works well.  Seems just a tad washed out, like it could use a little more contrast.  ???  Just a thought.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2010-04-05 09:59:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5931432, 859289, 30049, '<td valign="top">Nice control on exposure to keep the flame from blowing out (no pun intended) the highlights.  The setting is nice.  Not sure about the back candles.  I think I''d either like them in focus or if not then more OOF (shallower DOF on front).  All JMO of course.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Nice control on exposure to keep the flame from blowing out (no pun intended) the highlights.  The setting is nice.  Not sure about the back candles.  I think I''d either like them in focus or if not then more OOF (shallower DOF on front).  All JMO of course.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2010-04-05 10:01:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5931437, 864269, 30049, '<td valign="top">This photo has a fun effect to it.  I wonder how it would look with a star burst filter (on lens)?  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'This photo has a fun effect to it.  I wonder how it would look with a star burst filter (on lens)?  Good luck in the challenge.', '2010-04-05 10:03:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(5931438, 864205, 100393, '<td valign="top">I''m going through the entries, stopping at those images I feel have had the benefit of an unconventional eye and dwelling a little longer to try to see and appreciate what you saw. This is one of those images. <br/> <br/>Positives: A most unusual and interesting baby portrait. The deep shadows and colour temperate evoke a very warm cosseted feeling and the way the light (and your processing?) catches the fine body hair / down.<br/> <br/>Critical stuff: I do think I''m a bit conventional here and feel that better focus on the face / eye would have improved the image (despite the overall soft feel).<br/> <br/>Overall: Effective and unusual.</td>', 'I''m going through the entries, stopping at those images I feel have had the benefit of an unconventional eye and dwelling a little longer to try to see and appreciate what you saw. This is one of those images.  Positives: A most unusual and interesting baby portrait. The deep shadows and colour temperate evoke a very warm cosseted feeling and the way the light (and your processing?) catches the fine body hair / down. Critical stuff: I do think I''m a bit conventional here and feel that better focus on the face / eye would have improved the image (despite the overall soft feel). Overall: Effective and unusual.', '2010-04-05 10:04:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5931441, 859518, 30049, '<td valign="top">Outtake for ''Orange II''?  :-)  I like this overall.  Would like it better with just a little bit of room to the left.</td>', 'Outtake for ''Orange II''?  :-)  I like this overall.  Would like it better with just a little bit of room to the left.', '2010-04-05 10:07:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5931443, 863850, 30049, '<td valign="top">Cute...  A tad soft on focus, the window reflections are washing it out some, and the highlights are blown out.  Just some observations.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Cute...  A tad soft on focus, the window reflections are washing it out some, and the highlights are blown out.  Just some observations.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2010-04-05 10:09:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(5931445, 861323, 30049, '<td valign="top">This is a fun abstract type of image.  I might have taken a smidge off the bottom for better balance.  JMO.  Good luck.</td>', 'This is a fun abstract type of image.  I might have taken a smidge off the bottom for better balance.  JMO.  Good luck.', '2010-04-05 10:10:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5931447, 863441, 30049, '<td valign="top">I love the setting.  The yellows seem a little over-saturated, but that sometimes happens with late/early warm lighting.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'I love the setting.  The yellows seem a little over-saturated, but that sometimes happens with late/early warm lighting.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2010-04-05 10:12:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5931449, 860416, 30049, '<td valign="top">A serene, peaceful setting.  Nice.</td>', 'A serene, peaceful setting.  Nice.', '2010-04-05 10:13:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5931453, 863431, 30049, '<td valign="top">I like the props.  :-)  Lighting is a little strong/harsh.</td>', 'I like the props.  :-)  Lighting is a little strong/harsh.', '2010-04-05 10:14:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5931456, 862943, 100393, '<td valign="top">I''m going through the entries, stopping at those images I feel have had the benefit of an unconventional eye and dwelling a little longer to try to see and appreciate what you saw. This is one of those images. <br/> <br/>Positives: This is a very effective nude image - highly sensual without being at all risque. For me it is as much about the interplay of shadow and light than it is about the subject. I also like how controlled the image is in terms of framing - it actually feels a little constrained. I like that, it adds to a feeling of closeness.<br/> <br/>Critical stuff: Not much really.<br/> <br/>Overall: A very effective image - humanity and photography in equal measure.</td>', 'I''m going through the entries, stopping at those images I feel have had the benefit of an unconventional eye and dwelling a little longer to try to see and appreciate what you saw. This is one of those images.  Positives: This is a very effective nude image - highly sensual without being at all risque. For me it is as much about the interplay of shadow and light than it is about the subject. I also like how controlled the image is in terms of framing - it actually feels a little constrained. I like that, it adds to a feeling of closeness. Critical stuff: Not much really. Overall: A very effective image - humanity and photography in equal measure.', '2010-04-05 10:15:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5931458, 862307, 30049, '<td valign="top">Wide angle lens can be so much fun!  Cows are a very curious bunch aren''t they?  :-)  Nice capture.</td>', 'Wide angle lens can be so much fun!  Cows are a very curious bunch aren''t they?  :-)  Nice capture.', '2010-04-05 10:15:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5931461, 863209, 30049, '<td valign="top">Good use of tilt to get the abstract angles working here.  Might need a minor levels adjustment (not a major nit...just an observation) to make the colors pop a bit.  Good luck.</td>', 'Good use of tilt to get the abstract angles working here.  Might need a minor levels adjustment (not a major nit...just an observation) to make the colors pop a bit.  Good luck.', '2010-04-05 10:16:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(5931465, 861536, 100393, '<td valign="top">I''m going through the entries, stopping at those images I feel have had the benefit of an unconventional eye and dwelling a little longer to try to see and appreciate what you saw. This is one of those images. <br/> <br/>Positives: What a great stark image! One that confounds my sense of scale too - I''m not sure if this is architecture or a macro! The high contrast and sharpness and especially the black background conspire to give something that oozes clarity.<br/> <br/>Nothing at all : Even the border has been well judged and matched to perfection.<br/> <br/>Overall: A very accomplished image.</td>', 'I''m going through the entries, stopping at those images I feel have had the benefit of an unconventional eye and dwelling a little longer to try to see and appreciate what you saw. This is one of those images.  Positives: What a great stark image! One that confounds my sense of scale too - I''m not sure if this is architecture or a macro! The high contrast and sharpness and especially the black background conspire to give something that oozes clarity. Nothing at all : Even the border has been well judged and matched to perfection. Overall: A very accomplished image.', '2010-04-05 10:18:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5931466, 863308, 30049, '<td valign="top">Nice choice of aperture to keep the DOF tight.  Lighting is a little strong (blown out highlights on paw and shoulder).</td>', 'Nice choice of aperture to keep the DOF tight.  Lighting is a little strong (blown out highlights on paw and shoulder).', '2010-04-05 10:18:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5931468, 859686, 100393, '<td valign="top">I expect to see this on the front page. Great work.</td>', 'I expect to see this on the front page. Great work.', '2010-04-05 10:18:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5931470, 864248, 30049, '<td valign="top">Simple, yet effective.  Nicely done!</td>', 'Simple, yet effective.  Nicely done!', '2010-04-05 10:19:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5931478, 864067, 30049, '<td valign="top">It''s "ok", but it''s soft and slightly OOF.  I had fun looking at the reflection in the glasses for additional storyline.</td>', 'It''s "ok", but it''s soft and slightly OOF.  I had fun looking at the reflection in the glasses for additional storyline.', '2010-04-05 10:25:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5931485, 863681, 30049, '<td valign="top">Streaks are fun, been there done that...somewhat static as a subject overall.</td>', 'Streaks are fun, been there done that...somewhat static as a subject overall.', '2010-04-05 10:28:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5931487, 864206, 30049, '<td valign="top">Very nice B/W conversion.  Looks like this boat has a story or two to tell.  :-)</td>', 'Very nice B/W conversion.  Looks like this boat has a story or two to tell.  :-)', '2010-04-05 10:28:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(5931498, 863501, 30049, '<td valign="top">I like the sky (your subject based on title) - definitely dark and ominous.  The bridge is interesting, but not quite strong enough to make this a captivating image overall IMO.  Nothing personal, it''s just that the foreground vegetation and bare branches aren''t that appealing.  Nonetheless, good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'I like the sky (your subject based on title) - definitely dark and ominous.  The bridge is interesting, but not quite strong enough to make this a captivating image overall IMO.  Nothing personal, it''s just that the foreground vegetation and bare branches aren''t that appealing.  Nonetheless, good luck in the challenge.', '2010-04-05 10:32:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5931499, 864390, 30049, '<td valign="top">Nice diagonal lines...hard to control the zaggies isn''t it?</td>', 'Nice diagonal lines...hard to control the zaggies isn''t it?', '2010-04-05 10:33:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(5931500, 860141, 100393, '<td valign="top">I''m going through the entries, stopping at those images I feel have had the benefit of an unconventional eye and dwelling a little longer to try to see and appreciate what you saw. This is one of those images. <br/> <br/>Positives: So well executed. The distorted bokeh from the lights sells the image to me. I think having the focus set upon the inside of the car is a great choice too.<br/> <br/>Critical stuff: The blue car (Freelander??) behind detracts a little but there isn''t much you could''ve done about that.<br/> <br/>Overall: Nice, quirky image. I like it.</td>', 'I''m going through the entries, stopping at those images I feel have had the benefit of an unconventional eye and dwelling a little longer to try to see and appreciate what you saw. This is one of those images.  Positives: So well executed. The distorted bokeh from the lights sells the image to me. I think having the focus set upon the inside of the car is a great choice too. Critical stuff: The blue car (Freelander??) behind detracts a little but there isn''t much you could''ve done about that. Overall: Nice, quirky image. I like it.', '2010-04-05 10:33:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5931502, 863212, 30049, '<td valign="top">Action is good...would like to see more of the bike and less of the surrounding clutter (fence, walkway bridge, etc...)</td>', 'Action is good...would like to see more of the bike and less of the surrounding clutter (fence, walkway bridge, etc...)', '2010-04-05 10:34:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5931508, 864250, 30049, '<td valign="top">I like the flowers, but the mask is a bit creepy.  Lighting is a little strong (losing detail on the gloves).</td>', 'I like the flowers, but the mask is a bit creepy.  Lighting is a little strong (losing detail on the gloves).', '2010-04-05 10:36:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5931510, 864205, 30049, '<td valign="top">I''ve never seen a baby photograph in quite this manner.  Not sure I like the harsh treatment in post.</td>', 'I''ve never seen a baby photograph in quite this manner.  Not sure I like the harsh treatment in post.', '2010-04-05 10:37:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5931511, 863791, 30049, '<td valign="top">Great catch!  Would have worked perfect in the ''All things being equal...'' challenge.  :-)  I love the "expression" on the upper-right gull.</td>', 'Great catch!  Would have worked perfect in the ''All things being equal...'' challenge.  :-)  I love the "expression" on the upper-right gull.', '2010-04-05 10:38:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5931513, 864238, 30049, '<td valign="top">Sure have seen a lot of this place recently.  The spewing lava stands out nicely.  The rest of the photo looks to have some heavy noise reduction applied?</td>', 'Sure have seen a lot of this place recently.  The spewing lava stands out nicely.  The rest of the photo looks to have some heavy noise reduction applied?', '2010-04-05 10:39:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(5931515, 864227, 30049, '<td valign="top">Nice use of sun flare in a positive way.  Like the B/W conversion also.  Need to get rid of that black speck in the sky.  :-)</td>', 'Nice use of sun flare in a positive way.  Like the B/W conversion also.  Need to get rid of that black speck in the sky.  :-)', '2010-04-05 10:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(5931516, 859950, 100393, '<td valign="top">I''m going through the entries, stopping at those images I feel have had the benefit of an unconventional eye and dwelling a little longer to try to see and appreciate what you saw. This is one of those images. <br/> <br/>Positives: One of my favourites in the challenge - this is a wonderfully evocative image, full of story and beautifully executed - I particularly like the swaying / blown hair of the girl and her long shadow. The processing is bold too - the lateral highlights and the confidence you have in using the negative space at the bottom of the image is a great touch too.<br/> <br/>Critical stuff: Nothing.<br/> <br/>Overall: Great stuff. I wish the free studies were packed with interesting images like this.</td>', 'I''m going through the entries, stopping at those images I feel have had the benefit of an unconventional eye and dwelling a little longer to try to see and appreciate what you saw. This is one of those images.  Positives: One of my favourites in the challenge - this is a wonderfully evocative image, full of story and beautifully executed - I particularly like the swaying / blown hair of the girl and her long shadow. The processing is bold too - the lateral highlights and the confidence you have in using the negative space at the bottom of the image is a great touch too. Critical stuff: Nothing. Overall: Great stuff. I wish the free studies were packed with interesting images like this.', '2010-04-05 10:42:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5931517, 864117, 30049, '<td valign="top">I get the post treatment (reinforced by your title) applied to this image.  I like it overall - has a nice "feel" to it.  I wonder if it would be stronger with the blossoms a little lighter/brighter?  Just some observations.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'I get the post treatment (reinforced by your title) applied to this image.  I like it overall - has a nice "feel" to it.  I wonder if it would be stronger with the blossoms a little lighter/brighter?  Just some observations.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2010-04-05 10:42:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5931518, 864241, 100393, '<td valign="top">I know how hard it is to get such clarity with the DOFs associated with high macro. Very accomplished work.</td>', 'I know how hard it is to get such clarity with the DOFs associated with high macro. Very accomplished work.', '2010-04-05 10:43:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5931523, 864279, 100393, '<td valign="top">I''m going through the entries, stopping at those images I feel have had the benefit of an unconventional eye and dwelling a little longer to try to see and appreciate what you saw. This is one of those images. <br/> <br/>Positives: A nice grungy scene with interesting lighting that you have managed to capture very well.<br/> <br/>Critical stuff: I think I would''ve tried to get the verticals as vertical as possible. The overall interest level in the scene is quite low and I''m not sure that even the perfect photograph of this scene would do very well.<br/> <br/>Overall: Nice enough, but a bit limited in terms of interest level.</td>', 'I''m going through the entries, stopping at those images I feel have had the benefit of an unconventional eye and dwelling a little longer to try to see and appreciate what you saw. This is one of those images.  Positives: A nice grungy scene with interesting lighting that you have managed to capture very well. Critical stuff: I think I would''ve tried to get the verticals as vertical as possible. The overall interest level in the scene is quite low and I''m not sure that even the perfect photograph of this scene would do very well. Overall: Nice enough, but a bit limited in terms of interest level.', '2010-04-05 10:46:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5931532, 861947, 100393, '<td valign="top">I''m going through the entries, stopping at those images I feel have had the benefit of an unconventional eye and dwelling a little longer to try to see and appreciate what you saw. This is one of those images. <br/> <br/>Positives: I really like the ground glass look of this image; I really like the light too. It reminds me a little of some of <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=79602" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">AJHopp</a>''s work - so you must be hitting some of my buttons. I really like the angle of the edge of the surface with respect to the viewer.<br/> <br/>Critical stuff: Nothing at all.<br/> <br/>Overall: Very nice, well executed and very well balanced composition.</td>', 'I''m going through the entries, stopping at those images I feel have had the benefit of an unconventional eye and dwelling a little longer to try to see and appreciate what you saw. This is one of those images.  Positives: I really like the ground glass look of this image; I really like the light too. It reminds me a little of some of  AJHopp''s work - so you must be hitting some of my buttons. I really like the angle of the edge of the surface with respect to the viewer. Critical stuff: Nothing at all. Overall: Very nice, well executed and very well balanced composition.', '2010-04-05 10:51:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5931534, 863755, 100393, '<td valign="top">This is a lovely evocative portrait.</td>', 'This is a lovely evocative portrait.', '2010-04-05 10:51:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5931537, 864346, 100393, '<td valign="top">I''m going through the entries, stopping at those images I feel have had the benefit of an unconventional eye and dwelling a little longer to try to see and appreciate what you saw. This is one of those images. <br/> <br/>Positives: My word, I love, love, love this! Love the whoosh; love the colours; love the clouds; love the subtle vignette; love the fence ; love the cows!<br/> <br/>Critical stuff: Ummm....<br/> <br/>Overall: Great image - had instant appeal to me (no need for me to dwell very long at all!!)</td>', 'I''m going through the entries, stopping at those images I feel have had the benefit of an unconventional eye and dwelling a little longer to try to see and appreciate what you saw. This is one of those images.  Positives: My word, I love, love, love this! Love the whoosh; love the colours; love the clouds; love the subtle vignette; love the fence ; love the cows! Critical stuff: Ummm.... Overall: Great image - had instant appeal to me (no need for me to dwell very long at all!!)', '2010-04-05 10:54:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(5931541, 863008, 100393, '<td valign="top">I''m going through the entries, stopping at those images I feel have had the benefit of an unconventional eye and dwelling a little longer to try to see and appreciate what you saw. This is one of those images. <br/> <br/>Positives: I like the way this image is more about texture than form. The very high contrast works very well and the framing, constrained as it is, maintains a sense of mystery in the image.<br/> <br/>Critical stuff: No suggestions to make - any changes would be interference.<br/> <br/>Overall: Quite ''put-on-the-wall-able''; nice abstract nature image.</td>', 'I''m going through the entries, stopping at those images I feel have had the benefit of an unconventional eye and dwelling a little longer to try to see and appreciate what you saw. This is one of those images.  Positives: I like the way this image is more about texture than form. The very high contrast works very well and the framing, constrained as it is, maintains a sense of mystery in the image. Critical stuff: No suggestions to make - any changes would be interference. Overall: Quite ''put-on-the-wall-able''; nice abstract nature image.', '2010-04-05 10:59:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5931549, 864408, 100393, '<td valign="top">I''m going through the entries, stopping at those images I feel have had the benefit of an unconventional eye and dwelling a little longer to try to see and appreciate what you saw. This is one of those images. <br/> <br/>Positives: Interesting juxta / superimposition of elements - it does hold the eye for quite a while.<br/> <br/>Critical stuff: The image does feel incoherent to me, each element seems to avoid any support for any other to the extent that the image doesn''t feel at all ''crafted''. I''m not a fan of your conversion either - the toning seems a little flat.<br/> <br/>Overall: I do like images that make use of reflections but this one isn''t working for me.</td>', 'I''m going through the entries, stopping at those images I feel have had the benefit of an unconventional eye and dwelling a little longer to try to see and appreciate what you saw. This is one of those images.  Positives: Interesting juxta / superimposition of elements - it does hold the eye for quite a while. Critical stuff: The image does feel incoherent to me, each element seems to avoid any support for any other to the extent that the image doesn''t feel at all ''crafted''. I''m not a fan of your conversion either - the toning seems a little flat. Overall: I do like images that make use of reflections but this one isn''t working for me.', '2010-04-05 11:05:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5931579, 862004, 114578, '<td valign="top">Amazing shot... Good luck for the ribbon! 10</td>', 'Amazing shot... Good luck for the ribbon! 10', '2010-04-05 11:20:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5931589, 863870, 30049, '<td valign="top">I like B&amp;W for this.  Good comp and ''movement''.  May be a tad oversharpened?  I know this isn''t your fault necessarily, but the two objects in front of the goose (leaves I guess?) really do grab some attention.  Just some observations.  Good luck.</td>', 'I like B&W for this.  Good comp and ''movement''.  May be a tad oversharpened?  I know this isn''t your fault necessarily, but the two objects in front of the goose (leaves I guess?) really do grab some attention.  Just some observations.  Good luck.', '2010-04-05 11:23:29.000000', NULL, 1),
