(5931599, 863937, 30049, '<td valign="top">Wonderful early morning light!  I''m jealous.  :-)  Really need to take a trip back to the Shenandoah''s soon (no snow in our area though).  Very well balanced image.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Wonderful early morning light!  I''m jealous.  :-)  Really need to take a trip back to the Shenandoah''s soon (no snow in our area though).  Very well balanced image.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2010-04-05 11:28:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5931601, 864251, 30049, '<td valign="top">The makeup under the eyes is too strong...makes her look sad/tired, etc...  It seems also that you''ve lost some detail in post (left side of her face is smooth and featureless).</td>', 'The makeup under the eyes is too strong...makes her look sad/tired, etc...  It seems also that you''ve lost some detail in post (left side of her face is smooth and featureless).', '2010-04-05 11:30:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5931602, 864274, 30049, '<td valign="top">Love the dirt flying out the back!  Wish there was more of the horse and rider, and less of the track elements.</td>', 'Love the dirt flying out the back!  Wish there was more of the horse and rider, and less of the track elements.', '2010-04-05 11:30:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(5931607, 864293, 30049, '<td valign="top">Not sure what happened here...did you do some selective processing on her eyes?  Ideally, with a subject like this (and title driven also) the eyes should be clear and sharp.  I''m only guessing that it was some post work because her nose, mouth and eyebrows are detailed.</td>', 'Not sure what happened here...did you do some selective processing on her eyes?  Ideally, with a subject like this (and title driven also) the eyes should be clear and sharp.  I''m only guessing that it was some post work because her nose, mouth and eyebrows are detailed.', '2010-04-05 11:33:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(5931609, 864218, 30049, '<td valign="top">Good job of freezing the action.  Looks like a tight crop?  I mention this because of the substantial grain.  Grain in the blues is hard to avoid sometimes, but there''s a lot in the underside of the wings also.</td>', 'Good job of freezing the action.  Looks like a tight crop?  I mention this because of the substantial grain.  Grain in the blues is hard to avoid sometimes, but there''s a lot in the underside of the wings also.', '2010-04-05 11:35:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5931610, 863433, 30049, '<td valign="top">I like that you''ve kept the whites, white.  Not crazy about the sun spot blow out.  A graduated filter could have helped.  ???  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'I like that you''ve kept the whites, white.  Not crazy about the sun spot blow out.  A graduated filter could have helped.  ???  Good luck in the challenge.', '2010-04-05 11:37:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5931611, 863925, 30049, '<td valign="top">Cute.</td>', 'Cute.', '2010-04-05 11:37:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5931613, 863705, 30049, '<td valign="top">I like the flow.  Seems a little underexposed.  Clarify used to get the detail?</td>', 'I like the flow.  Seems a little underexposed.  Clarify used to get the detail?', '2010-04-05 11:38:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5931614, 864141, 30049, '<td valign="top">Nice idea.  Little bit dark and not quite sharp on the main subject.</td>', 'Nice idea.  Little bit dark and not quite sharp on the main subject.', '2010-04-05 11:39:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5931618, 863840, 30049, '<td valign="top">Love the B/W conversion on this.  Good comp with plenty to look at in an interesting way.  The buildings may be a little sharp.</td>', 'Love the B/W conversion on this.  Good comp with plenty to look at in an interesting way.  The buildings may be a little sharp.', '2010-04-05 11:41:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5931621, 864378, 30049, '<td valign="top">Different.  To be quite honest, I''m not too crazy about the foreground scratched up glass.</td>', 'Different.  To be quite honest, I''m not too crazy about the foreground scratched up glass.', '2010-04-05 11:42:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5931622, 863759, 30049, '<td valign="top">Good detail and nice color.</td>', 'Good detail and nice color.', '2010-04-05 11:42:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(5931625, 864140, 30049, '<td valign="top">Nice blue gradient in the sky.  Good use of foreground elements.  A pleasing image overall.</td>', 'Nice blue gradient in the sky.  Good use of foreground elements.  A pleasing image overall.', '2010-04-05 11:43:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5931626, 864118, 30049, '<td valign="top">This could work in a magazine supporting a tourist advertisement.  Crisp, interesting lighting.  Nice.  Stock potential for sure!  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'This could work in a magazine supporting a tourist advertisement.  Crisp, interesting lighting.  Nice.  Stock potential for sure!  Good luck in the challenge.', '2010-04-05 11:44:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5931629, 863519, 30049, '<td valign="top">I love how the cloud reflections find their way over the bottom step!  Sharp, good color, interesting comp.  Nicely done!</td>', 'I love how the cloud reflections find their way over the bottom step!  Sharp, good color, interesting comp.  Nicely done!', '2010-04-05 11:45:39.000000', NULL, 1),
