(5931830, 864385, 23484, '<td valign="top">Excellent street shot and great treatment. Love the angle.</td>', 'Excellent street shot and great treatment. Love the angle.', '2010-04-05 13:54:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5931834, 864100, 23484, '<td valign="top">That is an incredible capture.</td>', 'That is an incredible capture.', '2010-04-05 13:55:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5931835, 860757, 23484, '<td valign="top">This is interesting in B&amp;W. Nice</td>', 'This is interesting in B&W. Nice', '2010-04-05 13:55:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5931837, 864348, 23484, '<td valign="top">Very nice detail DOF. Great job.</td>', 'Very nice detail DOF. Great job.', '2010-04-05 13:56:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5931839, 864267, 23484, '<td valign="top">Fantastic job. I like this.</td>', 'Fantastic job. I like this.', '2010-04-05 13:56:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5931970, 863509, 30049, '<td valign="top">I can understand the interest in this subject - it''s a pretty scene.  The image seems a little bit soft (could be intentional I guess).  Darn powerlines are an eyesore.  I suppose they could be legally edited out in Advanced, but I doubt I''d have the patience for doing it either.  :-)</td>', 'I can understand the interest in this subject - it''s a pretty scene.  The image seems a little bit soft (could be intentional I guess).  Darn powerlines are an eyesore.  I suppose they could be legally edited out in Advanced, but I doubt I''d have the patience for doing it either.  :-)', '2010-04-05 15:21:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5931971, 863578, 30049, '<td valign="top">Not sure how you could have controlled the exposure better (maybe combine two different ones) to keep the volcanic action and the lights from overexposing.  The snowy mountain and foreground are fine...</td>', 'Not sure how you could have controlled the exposure better (maybe combine two different ones) to keep the volcanic action and the lights from overexposing.  The snowy mountain and foreground are fine...', '2010-04-05 15:22:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5931972, 863920, 30049, '<td valign="top">I like the glow from this night scene.  Could be a little sharper maybe, but it''s still a well done photo.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'I like the glow from this night scene.  Could be a little sharper maybe, but it''s still a well done photo.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2010-04-05 15:23:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5931973, 863727, 30049, '<td valign="top">Lost a lot of detail along the way in the moth.</td>', 'Lost a lot of detail along the way in the moth.', '2010-04-05 15:24:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5931975, 864360, 30049, '<td valign="top">A pleasing photo overall.  I think I''d like the water smoothed out more (longer exposure), but that''s a personal preference.</td>', 'A pleasing photo overall.  I think I''d like the water smoothed out more (longer exposure), but that''s a personal preference.', '2010-04-05 15:25:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5931978, 864385, 30049, '<td valign="top">Looks like the focal point is across the street.  The subject is a bit blurry.</td>', 'Looks like the focal point is across the street.  The subject is a bit blurry.', '2010-04-05 15:26:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5931980, 864263, 30049, '<td valign="top">This hurts my eyes.  Really.  The photo seems to be dancing around on the screen.  I''ve viewed abstracts before.  Maybe it''s the combination of numerous blurry vertical lines with the brightness in between.  Weird.</td>', 'This hurts my eyes.  Really.  The photo seems to be dancing around on the screen.  I''ve viewed abstracts before.  Maybe it''s the combination of numerous blurry vertical lines with the brightness in between.  Weird.', '2010-04-05 15:28:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5931982, 861741, 30049, '<td valign="top">I like the reflection.  Image seems harsh (lighting) and over-sharpened.</td>', 'I like the reflection.  Image seems harsh (lighting) and over-sharpened.', '2010-04-05 15:29:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5931985, 864002, 30049, '<td valign="top">Great detail!  Not sure about the all white background (losing some edging on the birds breast area).</td>', 'Great detail!  Not sure about the all white background (losing some edging on the birds breast area).', '2010-04-05 15:30:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5931987, 863830, 30049, '<td valign="top">Feels touristy, but provides the information needed.</td>', 'Feels touristy, but provides the information needed.', '2010-04-05 15:31:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(5931989, 864386, 30049, '<td valign="top">Took trip to the zoo, eh?  :-)  You handled the environment well.  Seeing some artifacts of the enclosure and it''s a little bit grainy.  Nice detail in the hair.  Good luck.</td>', 'Took trip to the zoo, eh?  :-)  You handled the environment well.  Seeing some artifacts of the enclosure and it''s a little bit grainy.  Nice detail in the hair.  Good luck.', '2010-04-05 15:33:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5931994, 863848, 83313, '<td valign="top">Sweet engine. Looking forward to finding out where this one is. I spent Saturday afternoon waiting on the one we have here. It was worth the wait. A shame I didn''t have the shots for the planes &amp; trains challenge a couple of weeks back. These old steam engines are very impressive.</td>', 'Sweet engine. Looking forward to finding out where this one is. I spent Saturday afternoon waiting on the one we have here. It was worth the wait. A shame I didn''t have the shots for the planes & trains challenge a couple of weeks back. These old steam engines are very impressive.', '2010-04-05 15:35:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5931995, 861529, 30049, '<td valign="top">Sex sells, eh?  It''s a proper model shot with all of the right equipment.  Not a big fan of setup model poses personally.</td>', 'Sex sells, eh?  It''s a proper model shot with all of the right equipment.  Not a big fan of setup model poses personally.', '2010-04-05 15:35:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5931998, 860712, 30049, '<td valign="top">Nice environmental portrait.  A little over the top on color saturation maybe (especially the blue tones), but nonetheless well seen and captured.  Good luck.</td>', 'Nice environmental portrait.  A little over the top on color saturation maybe (especially the blue tones), but nonetheless well seen and captured.  Good luck.', '2010-04-05 15:36:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5932003, 863652, 30049, '<td valign="top">Cute!  Would like to see more of his "face" (eyes in particular) and/or some action (flying snow).  Certainly one to print and keep in a family album.</td>', 'Cute!  Would like to see more of his "face" (eyes in particular) and/or some action (flying snow).  Certainly one to print and keep in a family album.', '2010-04-05 15:38:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5932005, 861534, 30049, '<td valign="top">Great detail.  Perhaps a little static in the comp (centered) but still a very nice capture.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Great detail.  Perhaps a little static in the comp (centered) but still a very nice capture.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2010-04-05 15:39:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5932006, 863607, 30049, '<td valign="top">Sorry, finding this a little uninteresting as subject material.  On a technical note, the focal plane is really narrow with only the lower central area being sharply focused.</td>', 'Sorry, finding this a little uninteresting as subject material.  On a technical note, the focal plane is really narrow with only the lower central area being sharply focused.', '2010-04-05 15:40:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(5932007, 861947, 30049, '<td valign="top">I like the light play - don''t care for the grain.</td>', 'I like the light play - don''t care for the grain.', '2010-04-05 15:41:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5932008, 863962, 30049, '<td valign="top">Cute title - "ok" photo.</td>', 'Cute title - "ok" photo.', '2010-04-05 15:41:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5932011, 863946, 30049, '<td valign="top">It''s fun, but I think you tried to include too much.  This would possibly have more impact with a much tighter presentation (take 35-40% of the top part off).  You''d show more detail in her face/hair/eyes and eliminate the weaker part of this photo, which is the glare on the material in the upper parts of her costume.  All JMO of course.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'It''s fun, but I think you tried to include too much.  This would possibly have more impact with a much tighter presentation (take 35-40% of the top part off).  You''d show more detail in her face/hair/eyes and eliminate the weaker part of this photo, which is the glare on the material in the upper parts of her costume.  All JMO of course.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2010-04-05 15:46:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5932012, 864408, 30049, '<td valign="top">A very busy photo, that''s for sure.  Good luck.</td>', 'A very busy photo, that''s for sure.  Good luck.', '2010-04-05 15:47:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5932016, 864254, 30049, '<td valign="top">Have seen a handful of these now.  I like the detail this has compared to some others.  It''s funny...this one has more detail in the areas outside of the lava plumes, but in yours the lava and smoke are blurred from the long exposure.  Maybe a combination of multiple exposures to get detail in both?  Just some observations.  Good luck.</td>', 'Have seen a handful of these now.  I like the detail this has compared to some others.  It''s funny...this one has more detail in the areas outside of the lava plumes, but in yours the lava and smoke are blurred from the long exposure.  Maybe a combination of multiple exposures to get detail in both?  Just some observations.  Good luck.', '2010-04-05 15:49:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5932017, 859740, 83313, '<td valign="top">7 for the photo, +1 because I love your title.</td>', '7 for the photo, +1 because I love your title.', '2010-04-05 15:50:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5932019, 863123, 30049, '<td valign="top">She looks posed uncomfortably.  I''m not a big fan of posed studio model shots, however, this is setup somewhat more interesting with the different lighting effect you''ve achieved.</td>', 'She looks posed uncomfortably.  I''m not a big fan of posed studio model shots, however, this is setup somewhat more interesting with the different lighting effect you''ve achieved.', '2010-04-05 15:53:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5932021, 859283, 30049, '<td valign="top">Sorry, I don''t get it.  What''s the show?  The fiery thing in the middle?</td>', 'Sorry, I don''t get it.  What''s the show?  The fiery thing in the middle?', '2010-04-05 15:54:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5932022, 864099, 30049, '<td valign="top">Quite unusual.  Not really sure I''m liking that much as a photo.  Looks more like a painting or something.</td>', 'Quite unusual.  Not really sure I''m liking that much as a photo.  Looks more like a painting or something.', '2010-04-05 15:55:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5932023, 863132, 30049, '<td valign="top">Staged, not staged...can''t tell, and doesn''t matter either way in this case.  You''ve captured a wonderful image here.  Nice balance in the comp.  Exposure for the lighting is right on the mark.  Well done!</td>', 'Staged, not staged...can''t tell, and doesn''t matter either way in this case.  You''ve captured a wonderful image here.  Nice balance in the comp.  Exposure for the lighting is right on the mark.  Well done!', '2010-04-05 15:57:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5932026, 859136, 83313, '<td valign="top">Grog need this power. Grog gives you finest female for magic blade that cuts rock. Female make many strong offspring for you. You take now. Grog will defeat enemies and be even greater than Grog is now!<br/> <br/>You mark comment helpful or Grog will send Thag and Kron to attack with sharp pointy sticks. Or maybe not... Grog forget you still have magic blade. Thag and Kron are brave, not stupid.</td>', 'Grog need this power. Grog gives you finest female for magic blade that cuts rock. Female make many strong offspring for you. You take now. Grog will defeat enemies and be even greater than Grog is now! You mark comment helpful or Grog will send Thag and Kron to attack with sharp pointy sticks. Or maybe not... Grog forget you still have magic blade. Thag and Kron are brave, not stupid.', '2010-04-05 16:01:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5932029, 864254, 86218, '<td valign="top">8 Great capture and thanks for showing  this natural phenom. Lovely comp and mood with skyline and shoftness contrasted with the harshness of the land. Wish I could see this in person</td>', '8 Great capture and thanks for showing  this natural phenom. Lovely comp and mood with skyline and shoftness contrasted with the harshness of the land. Wish I could see this in person', '2010-04-05 16:05:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5932034, 864281, 86218, '<td valign="top">Lovely simple and peacefull. My pref is to have maybe a young child in this and it would really lift this with a touch of colour, since you chose to keep it in colour. B&amp;W would have been different. There also seems to be something in the fore that distracts a bit..o.o.f. branches? Everything is there for an 8/9. Dropping it to 7 for above reasons</td>', 'Lovely simple and peacefull. My pref is to have maybe a young child in this and it would really lift this with a touch of colour, since you chose to keep it in colour. B&W would have been different. There also seems to be something in the fore that distracts a bit..o.o.f. branches? Everything is there for an 8/9. Dropping it to 7 for above reasons', '2010-04-05 16:09:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5932038, 863441, 86218, '<td valign="top">Nice comp, nice mood. colours a bit unnatural. Still a very nice pic. The boy an element thats missing in so many other pictures that just helps to lift this image.</td>', 'Nice comp, nice mood. colours a bit unnatural. Still a very nice pic. The boy an element thats missing in so many other pictures that just helps to lift this image.', '2010-04-05 16:11:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5932044, 863507, 86218, '<td valign="top">Lovely shot and the water really draws me into this pic. I always love this. Sky is magic and the pp on this just to good. ( in my books at least) There is a Clifton shot as well but looking at this it has to be Philip. Curious to know. Whishing you the best, this pic deserves to be in top 5</td>', 'Lovely shot and the water really draws me into this pic. I always love this. Sky is magic and the pp on this just to good. ( in my books at least) There is a Clifton shot as well but looking at this it has to be Philip. Curious to know. Whishing you the best, this pic deserves to be in top 5', '2010-04-05 16:15:24.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(5932045, 864380, 73235, '<td valign="top">beautiful details and textures</td>', 'beautiful details and textures', '2010-04-05 16:15:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5932046, 864360, 73235, '<td valign="top">good abstract</td>', 'good abstract', '2010-04-05 16:15:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5932047, 859809, 73235, '<td valign="top">yes it does convey ''evening mood''</td>', 'yes it does convey ''evening mood''', '2010-04-05 16:16:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5932048, 863938, 73235, '<td valign="top">I like the high contrast you used to set the red apart</td>', 'I like the high contrast you used to set the red apart', '2010-04-05 16:17:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5932050, 861147, 73235, '<td valign="top">great use of the shallow DOF and the muted colors</td>', 'great use of the shallow DOF and the muted colors', '2010-04-05 16:17:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(5932051, 864184, 86218, '<td valign="top">Wow. What an event to capture. I cant imagine what it must be like to witness this nevermind capture. Lovely image</td>', 'Wow. What an event to capture. I cant imagine what it must be like to witness this nevermind capture. Lovely image', '2010-04-05 16:17:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5932052, 864278, 30049, '<td valign="top">Interesting flower bud.  Lighting appears to be mid-day?  Might have been more appealing with early or late day sunlight.  Just a thought.  Good luck.</td>', 'Interesting flower bud.  Lighting appears to be mid-day?  Might have been more appealing with early or late day sunlight.  Just a thought.  Good luck.', '2010-04-05 16:18:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5932053, 863705, 73235, '<td valign="top">interesting composition, cuttin the picture in half by a diagonal line and separating bright from dark tones.</td>', 'interesting composition, cuttin the picture in half by a diagonal line and separating bright from dark tones.', '2010-04-05 16:19:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5932054, 859686, 30049, '<td valign="top">Wow.  Great detail in the eye and forehead.  I can understand wanting to isolate the eye(s), but I think you went too far in obliterating everything else in post.  JMO of course.  Good luck.</td>', 'Wow.  Great detail in the eye and forehead.  I can understand wanting to isolate the eye(s), but I think you went too far in obliterating everything else in post.  JMO of course.  Good luck.', '2010-04-05 16:19:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5932057, 864297, 30049, '<td valign="top">Different.</td>', 'Different.', '2010-04-05 16:20:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5932060, 863441, 73235, '<td valign="top">I''m not too fond of this processing. The grens are too saturated for my taste.</td>', 'I''m not too fond of this processing. The grens are too saturated for my taste.', '2010-04-05 16:20:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5932064, 859809, 30049, '<td valign="top">I like the lighting.  Subject may be a bit ho-humish (get''s lost somewhat in the busy comp).</td>', 'I like the lighting.  Subject may be a bit ho-humish (get''s lost somewhat in the busy comp).', '2010-04-05 16:20:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5932067, 861677, 86218, '<td valign="top">Powerfull image, comp and elements with curves, lines and mood  so powerfull. Really love this.</td>', 'Powerfull image, comp and elements with curves, lines and mood  so powerfull. Really love this.', '2010-04-05 16:21:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5932069, 863780, 73235, '<td valign="top">strong composition and very bold to convert to b/w. but it works well.</td>', 'strong composition and very bold to convert to b/w. but it works well.', '2010-04-05 16:21:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5932072, 863740, 30049, '<td valign="top">Whoa!  This is WAY over the top.  Sorry, but I don''t see the relevance of the crazy post processing to the extreme that this has been taken.</td>', 'Whoa!  This is WAY over the top.  Sorry, but I don''t see the relevance of the crazy post processing to the extreme that this has been taken.', '2010-04-05 16:21:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5932073, 859553, 73235, '<td valign="top">a bit too busy for my taste, nothing really to focus on.</td>', 'a bit too busy for my taste, nothing really to focus on.', '2010-04-05 16:22:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(5932074, 864170, 30049, '<td valign="top">Great job on controlling the exposure and using available lighting on this!  Not normally a big fan of heavy vignetting, but it works pretty well here.</td>', 'Great job on controlling the exposure and using available lighting on this!  Not normally a big fan of heavy vignetting, but it works pretty well here.', '2010-04-05 16:23:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5932075, 863946, 73235, '<td valign="top">great capture and well done to mute the colors.</td>', 'great capture and well done to mute the colors.', '2010-04-05 16:23:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(5932076, 862526, 30049, '<td valign="top">Seems more like a graphic illustration than a photo.</td>', 'Seems more like a graphic illustration than a photo.', '2010-04-05 16:23:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5932077, 863543, 30049, '<td valign="top">Cute title.  Well executed photo too!  :-)  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Cute title.  Well executed photo too!  :-)  Good luck in the challenge.', '2010-04-05 16:24:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5932079, 864266, 30049, '<td valign="top">Very nice vintage feel to this with the early model truck and the older store fronts.  Nice B&amp;W conversion.  One thing that''s a bit strange is the border at the top; the line between it and the photo is less distinct than at the bottom...seems to blend in.</td>', 'Very nice vintage feel to this with the early model truck and the older store fronts.  Nice B&W conversion.  One thing that''s a bit strange is the border at the top; the line between it and the photo is less distinct than at the bottom...seems to blend in.', '2010-04-05 16:26:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(5932082, 863785, 30049, '<td valign="top">I know I''m suppose to "ponder" this....<br/> <br/>....ok, I''ve pondered.  The post treatment makes this seem like a watercolor painting on coarse paper or something.  It''s ok - but doesn''t really seem like a photo anymore.  JMO.  Good luck.</td>', 'I know I''m suppose to "ponder" this.... ....ok, I''ve pondered.  The post treatment makes this seem like a watercolor painting on coarse paper or something.  It''s ok - but doesn''t really seem like a photo anymore.  JMO.  Good luck.', '2010-04-05 16:28:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5932083, 864142, 30049, '<td valign="top">Some HDR working here, eh?   I guess it''s ok...seems like there''s something missing.  Maybe a little less sky and more substance (road and fence)?  Just thinking out loud.  Good luck.</td>', 'Some HDR working here, eh?   I guess it''s ok...seems like there''s something missing.  Maybe a little less sky and more substance (road and fence)?  Just thinking out loud.  Good luck.', '2010-04-05 16:29:42.000000', NULL, 1),
