(5932103, 861689, 30049, '<td valign="top">Ok, here''s a portrait studio shot that makes sense!  There''s a purpose for this photo other than putting a pretty/sexy woman on a white background.  Some parent is going to be proudly displaying this photo on prominent wall in their home.  Very well done!  Great lighting, and good DOF yet plenty of detail where needed (eyes are on the fringe of being too sharp IMO - not quite, but close).  Bravo!  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Ok, here''s a portrait studio shot that makes sense!  There''s a purpose for this photo other than putting a pretty/sexy woman on a white background.  Some parent is going to be proudly displaying this photo on prominent wall in their home.  Very well done!  Great lighting, and good DOF yet plenty of detail where needed (eyes are on the fringe of being too sharp IMO - not quite, but close).  Bravo!  Good luck in the challenge.', '2010-04-05 16:39:25.000000', NULL, 1),
