(5932978, 864197, 86218, '<td valign="top">Lovely comp and rich colours. This always goes down well with voters and no different with this study Im sure. You had a very special day here and you did justice to the moment.</td>', 'Lovely comp and rich colours. This always goes down well with voters and no different with this study Im sure. You had a very special day here and you did justice to the moment.', '2010-04-06 07:45:45.000000', NULL, 1),
