(5933164, 864400, 30049, '<td valign="top">Reminds me of the baby on the financial commercial.  :-)   I like the B&amp;W conversion...not so keen on the oversharpened eyes and the hot (no detail) whites on the shirt and blanket.  Just some observations.  Good luck.</td>', 'Reminds me of the baby on the financial commercial.  :-)   I like the B&W conversion...not so keen on the oversharpened eyes and the hot (no detail) whites on the shirt and blanket.  Just some observations.  Good luck.', '2010-04-06 10:12:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5933166, 863893, 30049, '<td valign="top">Traditional comp for a portrait is good.  Lighting is very good.  Eyes are oversharpened.  Juries still out on the hand in front of the face...doesn''t quite feel right.  Just some observations.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Traditional comp for a portrait is good.  Lighting is very good.  Eyes are oversharpened.  Juries still out on the hand in front of the face...doesn''t quite feel right.  Just some observations.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2010-04-06 10:14:40.000000', NULL, 1),
