(5933318, 864389, 30049, '<td valign="top">Great detail!  There''s a ton of "subjects" and compositions available here in this scene.  The one you chose to submit is pleasing overall.  The lighting is delightful with the shadows to add depth and interest.  Only nit (minor) for me is I think I''d like to see more of "something" than the overall scene.  Maybe something with a lower POV and less sky?  Just some observations.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Great detail!  There''s a ton of "subjects" and compositions available here in this scene.  The one you chose to submit is pleasing overall.  The lighting is delightful with the shadows to add depth and interest.  Only nit (minor) for me is I think I''d like to see more of "something" than the overall scene.  Maybe something with a lower POV and less sky?  Just some observations.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2010-04-06 11:50:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5933322, 864279, 30049, '<td valign="top">I like the way the ladder is framed in the doorway.  The lighting is pleasing and works well for impact.  Can''t help but feeling like I''m leaning to the left and want to "straighten" the photo.  :-)</td>', 'I like the way the ladder is framed in the doorway.  The lighting is pleasing and works well for impact.  Can''t help but feeling like I''m leaning to the left and want to "straighten" the photo.  :-)', '2010-04-06 11:51:49.000000', NULL, 1),
