(5933411, 860873, 30049, '<td valign="top">Quick - straighten this out before all the water runs out of the lake!!!  I like this scene and I think it has more potential for something really dynamic than what you presented.  First, straighten the horizon.  Second thing I''d consider is much less sky and more emphasis on the fishermen.  Just some observations.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Quick - straighten this out before all the water runs out of the lake!!!  I like this scene and I think it has more potential for something really dynamic than what you presented.  First, straighten the horizon.  Second thing I''d consider is much less sky and more emphasis on the fishermen.  Just some observations.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2010-04-06 12:52:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5933412, 864295, 30049, '<td valign="top">Fun use of a fisheye!  Nice crisp detail and focus.  The sky cooperated well that day too.</td>', 'Fun use of a fisheye!  Nice crisp detail and focus.  The sky cooperated well that day too.', '2010-04-06 12:53:04.000000', NULL, 1),
