(5933713, 864182, 30049, '<td valign="top">I like the wispy clouds.  Other than that, honestly, it''s just another pretty sunset.  Problem is that there are so many sunset shots/opportunities here that you really need an ideal location with a good foreground object and a clean/interesting palette.  For example, the fence in your foreground.  It directs the viewer somewhat down and out.  The one thing in this photo that I do really find interesting, and could be capitalized on, is the palm tree reflection in the sunlit water.  Isolate that, or find a way to make that a bigger part of your comp, and then you''ll have something that voters may get excited about.  <br/> <br/>All JMO of course.  :-)  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'I like the wispy clouds.  Other than that, honestly, it''s just another pretty sunset.  Problem is that there are so many sunset shots/opportunities here that you really need an ideal location with a good foreground object and a clean/interesting palette.  For example, the fence in your foreground.  It directs the viewer somewhat down and out.  The one thing in this photo that I do really find interesting, and could be capitalized on, is the palm tree reflection in the sunlit water.  Isolate that, or find a way to make that a bigger part of your comp, and then you''ll have something that voters may get excited about.   All JMO of course.  :-)  Good luck in the challenge.', '2010-04-06 16:40:29.000000', NULL, 1),
