(5934341, 864177, 30049, '<td valign="top">Nice color.  Good detail.  I suspect some HDR or Topaz, but if used, it was used effectively.  Slight perception of the far horizon tilting to the right, but there''s so many lines in this photo it''s hard to tell if your eyes are tricking you or not.  Nicely seen and captured.  Good luck.</td>', 'Nice color.  Good detail.  I suspect some HDR or Topaz, but if used, it was used effectively.  Slight perception of the far horizon tilting to the right, but there''s so many lines in this photo it''s hard to tell if your eyes are tricking you or not.  Nicely seen and captured.  Good luck.', '2010-04-07 00:31:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5934346, 864356, 30049, '<td valign="top">Nice low POV and good use of a foreground element.  May be a little close to having your horizon (distant shoreline) dead centered, which takes away from the dynamic just a smidge.  Just some observations.  Good luck.</td>', 'Nice low POV and good use of a foreground element.  May be a little close to having your horizon (distant shoreline) dead centered, which takes away from the dynamic just a smidge.  Just some observations.  Good luck.', '2010-04-07 00:33:10.000000', NULL, 1),
