(5935238, 864252, 86218, '<td valign="top">Brilliant work. You have two winners here. Even closed eyes by the lamb. Whoever this is, or the parents of this girl can have this enlarged and framed. I never thought I would give a 10 for a pic like this (portrait style) I dont believe Ive given a 10 yet in this FS challenge. PS Simply for the emotions in this and symbolism in htis. im not a portrait pperson and sure others could tell you what to correct in this but it remains a picture above all the rest for me</td>', 'Brilliant work. You have two winners here. Even closed eyes by the lamb. Whoever this is, or the parents of this girl can have this enlarged and framed. I never thought I would give a 10 for a pic like this (portrait style) I dont believe Ive given a 10 yet in this FS challenge. PS Simply for the emotions in this and symbolism in htis. im not a portrait pperson and sure others could tell you what to correct in this but it remains a picture above all the rest for me', '2010-04-07 11:09:54.000000', NULL, 1),
