(5935547, 863940, 30049, '<td valign="top">I can understand the POV...however, the time of day really worked against you with very strong/harsh sunlight.   The POV does create a fun, humorous feel with the horse''s head appearing to be HUGE in comparison to his skinny little neck.  :-)  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'I can understand the POV...however, the time of day really worked against you with very strong/harsh sunlight.   The POV does create a fun, humorous feel with the horse''s head appearing to be HUGE in comparison to his skinny little neck.  :-)  Good luck in the challenge.', '2010-04-07 14:28:38.000000', NULL, 1),
