(5935574, 863821, 30049, '<td valign="top"><strike>I don''t think you went deep enough, or y</strike> You tried to include too much in this comp. ??? I say that because the wood of the building is becoming featureless.  The sky looks painterly (not good or bad - just an observation).<br/> <br/>Hmmm.  I''m really having a hard time with this photo.  I like the general idea of it, but feel like I can''t really take it all in.  This could be the case of needing more real estate to really showcase the photo?  Sorry.  Just thinking out loud I guess.  Best of luck to you in the challenge.</td>', 'I don''t think you went deep enough, or y You tried to include too much in this comp. ??? I say that because the wood of the building is becoming featureless.  The sky looks painterly (not good or bad - just an observation). Hmmm.  I''m really having a hard time with this photo.  I like the general idea of it, but feel like I can''t really take it all in.  This could be the case of needing more real estate to really showcase the photo?  Sorry.  Just thinking out loud I guess.  Best of luck to you in the challenge.', '2010-04-07 14:35:26.000000', NULL, 1),
