(5935604, 864212, 30049, '<td valign="top">Not sure if your intent was to capture a photo like this (slightly OOF and blurred) or if you just worked with what you had in post to create this ''artwork'' type image.  ???  In the end it feels more like a painting than a photograph.  Still kinda neat in an artful way.</td>', 'Not sure if your intent was to capture a photo like this (slightly OOF and blurred) or if you just worked with what you had in post to create this ''artwork'' type image.  ???  In the end it feels more like a painting than a photograph.  Still kinda neat in an artful way.', '2010-04-07 14:43:08.000000', NULL, 1),
