(5935627, 861677, 30049, '<td valign="top">I like how you kept the tones natural (minus the edge burning of course).  It feels like I could be right there (reminds me of the winter dunes in Michigan as a kid).</td>', 'I like how you kept the tones natural (minus the edge burning of course).  It feels like I could be right there (reminds me of the winter dunes in Michigan as a kid).', '2010-04-07 15:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
