(5935631, 863841, 30049, '<td valign="top">Hmmm.  Not sure about "Surreal"...  It''s a lovely location although the image is quite grey.  I like how you were able to catch the swirls in the water below the dropoff.</td>', 'Hmmm.  Not sure about "Surreal"...  It''s a lovely location although the image is quite grey.  I like how you were able to catch the swirls in the water below the dropoff.', '2010-04-07 15:02:25.000000', NULL, 1),
