(5935633, 863008, 30049, '<td valign="top">Nice texture and patterns.  Somehow it''s coming across somewhat harsh.  Could be the "busyness" or the B/W conversion and extreme contrast...not sure, just a feeling I get.</td>', 'Nice texture and patterns.  Somehow it''s coming across somewhat harsh.  Could be the "busyness" or the B/W conversion and extreme contrast...not sure, just a feeling I get.', '2010-04-07 15:05:17.000000', NULL, 1),
