(5935639, 864221, 30049, '<td valign="top">Looks like one wants to build a nest, and the other wants to fill the nest before it''s built.  :-)  Fun.  Good detail.  Somewhat grainy.</td>', 'Looks like one wants to build a nest, and the other wants to fill the nest before it''s built.  :-)  Fun.  Good detail.  Somewhat grainy.', '2010-04-07 15:07:49.000000', NULL, 1),
