(5935843, 863806, 76335, '<td valign="top">Nice composition -- could be sharper, though, and the lighting isn''t very flattering.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2010-04-08 20:58:21.</i></td>', 'Nice composition -- could be sharper, though, and the lighting isn''t very flattering.', '2010-04-07 17:41:55.000000', '2010-04-08 21:58:21.000000', 1),
