(5935848, 864378, 76335, '<td valign="top">This is <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=60915" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">nixter</a>. After seeing this originally, I went back to a phone booth that had some interesting textures and couldn''t mimic your attempt to save my life. It was probably the camera I was using -- it was a real challenge to get the textures on the glass in good focus. And the people passing by weren''t exactly going where I wanted them to. <br/> <br/>Anyway, great shot! I love this.</td>', 'This is  nixter. After seeing this originally, I went back to a phone booth that had some interesting textures and couldn''t mimic your attempt to save my life. It was probably the camera I was using -- it was a real challenge to get the textures on the glass in good focus. And the people passing by weren''t exactly going where I wanted them to.  Anyway, great shot! I love this.', '2010-04-07 17:45:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5935850, 859598, 76335, '<td valign="top">The subject and framing is good, but the lighting is dull and uninteresting. If you could shoot this with dramatic side lighting, and perhaps convert it to black and white, I think you''d get a good abstract effect.</td>', 'The subject and framing is good, but the lighting is dull and uninteresting. If you could shoot this with dramatic side lighting, and perhaps convert it to black and white, I think you''d get a good abstract effect.', '2010-04-07 17:47:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5935857, 861980, 76335, '<td valign="top">WOW! I''m sure that''s not a helpful comment. It''s my gut reaction, and I wanted to share it. This is terrific.</td>', 'WOW! I''m sure that''s not a helpful comment. It''s my gut reaction, and I wanted to share it. This is terrific.', '2010-04-07 17:50:02.000000', NULL, 1),
