(5935882, 863785, 76335, '<td valign="top">Simply awesome. I thought it might be a pinhole shot, but I would expect the waves to be more blurred from a longer exposure time. Doesn''t matter much; the end result is great.</td>', 'Simply awesome. I thought it might be a pinhole shot, but I would expect the waves to be more blurred from a longer exposure time. Doesn''t matter much; the end result is great.', '2010-04-07 18:03:14.000000', NULL, 1),
