(5936295, 861807, 65234, '<td valign="top">Like the title ;-)  Might like the image better if you crouched down a bit to get the vegetation out of the shot.  I just don''t think it adds to the story.</td>', 'Like the title ;-)  Might like the image better if you crouched down a bit to get the vegetation out of the shot.  I just don''t think it adds to the story.', '2010-04-07 21:34:13.000000', NULL, 1),
