(5936307, 859809, 63218, '<td valign="top">The attraction here for me is the way the BG interacts w/the FG, esp in the thumb.  Click it open &amp; it has a whole new charm, reminding me of Degas'' weary ballet dancers.</td>', 'The attraction here for me is the way the BG interacts w/the FG, esp in the thumb.  Click it open & it has a whole new charm, reminding me of Degas'' weary ballet dancers.', '2010-04-07 21:46:35.000000', NULL, 1),
