(5936376, 862181, 63218, '<td valign="top">The blue in this (on this monitor) is gorgeous, sets the rose off perfectly. Maybe I''m crazy but it doesn''t feel cold to me, the white looks more like mold. Vampire rose, maybe. "D</td>', 'The blue in this (on this monitor) is gorgeous, sets the rose off perfectly. Maybe I''m crazy but it doesn''t feel cold to me, the white looks more like mold. Vampire rose, maybe. "D', '2010-04-07 22:26:37.000000', NULL, 1),
