(5936586, 863429, 83313, '<td valign="top">A fascinating mixture of the mundane with an awesome landscape and bit of the slightly odd tossed in for good measure.</td>', 'A fascinating mixture of the mundane with an awesome landscape and bit of the slightly odd tossed in for good measure.', '2010-04-08 00:35:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5936589, 863608, 83313, '<td valign="top">I''m afraid this is being hurt by harsh flash and what looks like oversharpening artifacts. A little cutie, however.</td>', 'I''m afraid this is being hurt by harsh flash and what looks like oversharpening artifacts. A little cutie, however.', '2010-04-08 00:39:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5936594, 863008, 83313, '<td valign="top">Some fascinating textures here.</td>', 'Some fascinating textures here.', '2010-04-08 00:43:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5936596, 864218, 83313, '<td valign="top">As soft and grainy as this is, I have to assume the limitation here was not your skills, but the capability of the equipment you had. Lots of noise suggest this was either an extreme crop or done with a compact camera. Although we like to say "it''s the photographer, not the camera", the fact is that equipment does play a part.</td>', 'As soft and grainy as this is, I have to assume the limitation here was not your skills, but the capability of the equipment you had. Lots of noise suggest this was either an extreme crop or done with a compact camera. Although we like to say "it''s the photographer, not the camera", the fact is that equipment does play a part.', '2010-04-08 00:46:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(5936598, 859950, 83313, '<td valign="top">Oh, wow. I want to know how you got this effect.</td>', 'Oh, wow. I want to know how you got this effect.', '2010-04-08 00:49:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5936599, 859598, 83313, '<td valign="top">Doesn''t look like it''s flown in a while. Nice detail. Looks similar to some of my own aircraft shots. Is this on a T-6?</td>', 'Doesn''t look like it''s flown in a while. Nice detail. Looks similar to some of my own aircraft shots. Is this on a T-6?', '2010-04-08 00:51:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5936600, 862208, 66515, '<td valign="top">A bit oversharpened as I can see haloing around the edges of the hills/mountains.</td>', 'A bit oversharpened as I can see haloing around the edges of the hills/mountains.', '2010-04-08 00:51:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5936606, 863195, 66515, '<td valign="top">wow. The composition is so perfect that I can''t express anything except that single word. I mean the colors and the lighting and exposure are good but the composition totally makes this shot.  I expect to see this in the top 10 and hopefully with a blue ribbon!</td>', 'wow. The composition is so perfect that I can''t express anything except that single word. I mean the colors and the lighting and exposure are good but the composition totally makes this shot.  I expect to see this in the top 10 and hopefully with a blue ribbon!', '2010-04-08 00:54:31.000000', NULL, 1),
