(5937260, 862693, 68573, '<td valign="top">Agree to every word u''ve written. It''s so easy to shoot an unusual and rare subject the real talent lies in shooting the most common objects is such visually charming ways. I remember a very famous product photographer saying ''It''s doesn''t require much talent to shoot a hot women in few clothes, show me a picture of a bicycle pedal or a gearbox that can hold the eye for more than a second''<br/> <br/>You pictures are a visual treat, keep rocking!<br/> <br/></td>', 'Agree to every word u''ve written. It''s so easy to shoot an unusual and rare subject the real talent lies in shooting the most common objects is such visually charming ways. I remember a very famous product photographer saying ''It''s doesn''t require much talent to shoot a hot women in few clothes, show me a picture of a bicycle pedal or a gearbox that can hold the eye for more than a second'' You pictures are a visual treat, keep rocking! ', '2010-04-08 10:05:23.000000', NULL, 0),
