(5937347, 859502, 30214, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Bear_Music:</b></div><hr/><i> This is so excellent in so many ways... However, on my monitor at least you''ve totally posterized the reds/oranges int he sky to the point where it''s unacceptable; I wish you''d resisted the temptation. It''s a temptation I''ve fallen prey to many times in the past, and try to resist now.<br/></i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>hmm, the sky is bold but no posterized on my iMac screen... Gorgeous shot Jean, congrats! (wow, what a frontyard you have! :))</td>', 'Originally posted by Bear_Music: This is so excellent in so many ways... However, on my monitor at least you''ve totally posterized the reds/oranges int he sky to the point where it''s unacceptable; I wish you''d resisted the temptation. It''s a temptation I''ve fallen prey to many times in the past, and try to resist now.  hmm, the sky is bold but no posterized on my iMac screen... Gorgeous shot Jean, congrats! (wow, what a frontyard you have! :))', '2010-04-08 12:20:15.000000', NULL, 0),
