(5937358, 864346, 52336, '<td valign="top">Is my art appreciation sense broken?  Is my critical eye half-blind?  Everyone loves this, but on first viewing, it left me flat.  I knew what it was -- a drive-by.  I''ve seen some beautiful, engaging drive-bys that looked impressionistic, or surreal or dreamy, but this wasn''t the best, in my view.  It''s merely interesting, and to be worthwhile for me, it must be more than that.  It doesn''t have the beautiful power of your awesome "Changes", or the impressionistic sense of your "Arpeggio", and seemed more like an exercise rather than a piece of art.  I''m surprised by the reaction, but happy for you.  Congrats.</td>', 'Is my art appreciation sense broken?  Is my critical eye half-blind?  Everyone loves this, but on first viewing, it left me flat.  I knew what it was -- a drive-by.  I''ve seen some beautiful, engaging drive-bys that looked impressionistic, or surreal or dreamy, but this wasn''t the best, in my view.  It''s merely interesting, and to be worthwhile for me, it must be more than that.  It doesn''t have the beautiful power of your awesome "Changes", or the impressionistic sense of your "Arpeggio", and seemed more like an exercise rather than a piece of art.  I''m surprised by the reaction, but happy for you.  Congrats.', '2010-04-08 12:34:12.000000', NULL, 0),
