(5937373, 863677, 34192, '<td valign="top">I gave this an 8 on my first pass.  I, unfortunately, never made it back for a second pass.  This is wonderful, one of my favorites in the challenge. I love the graphic, sparse feel of it, and the way it fights against the subject.  Well seen!</td>', 'I gave this an 8 on my first pass.  I, unfortunately, never made it back for a second pass.  This is wonderful, one of my favorites in the challenge. I love the graphic, sparse feel of it, and the way it fights against the subject.  Well seen!', '2010-04-08 12:58:49.000000', NULL, 0),
