(5937477, 861080, 30982, '<td valign="top">I love how everything is so straight and square.  When I shoot wide, everything warps!  Are you doing any straightening in post processing?  LOVELY photo, by the way!  In fact, I like this even better than your ribbon winner (which is a fine photo as well.)  This one has more depth, more fine detail in it. <br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2010-04-08 13:44:20.</i></td>', 'I love how everything is so straight and square.  When I shoot wide, everything warps!  Are you doing any straightening in post processing?  LOVELY photo, by the way!  In fact, I like this even better than your ribbon winner (which is a fine photo as well.)  This one has more depth, more fine detail in it. ', '2010-04-08 14:42:56.000000', '2010-04-08 14:44:20.000000', 0),
