(5937619, 864161, 95418, '<td valign="top"><br/>Hi from Critique Club.<br/> <br/>Here are my comments about Fleeting Youth:<br/> <br/>1 - Little contrast. More will help the image.<br/> <br/>2 - Focus only in the face region. I believe that the focus in the body could transform this in a more didatic photo.<br/> <br/>Hope you like the ideas.<br/> <br/>Oscar</td>', 'Hi from Critique Club. Here are my comments about Fleeting Youth: 1 - Little contrast. More will help the image. 2 - Focus only in the face region. I believe that the focus in the body could transform this in a more didatic photo. Hope you like the ideas. Oscar', '2010-04-08 16:19:39.000000', NULL, 0),
