(5937713, 864254, 61961, '<td valign="top">Terrific photo, and I''m pleased you got far more 6 and above votes than you got 5 and below!  Still, I think this should have placed higher.  I wonder if you suffered a bit in the voting because people at DPC have seen so many photos this past week of volcanic eruptions?</td>', 'Terrific photo, and I''m pleased you got far more 6 and above votes than you got 5 and below!  Still, I think this should have placed higher.  I wonder if you suffered a bit in the voting because people at DPC have seen so many photos this past week of volcanic eruptions?', '2010-04-08 17:36:16.000000', NULL, 0),
