(5937875, 863441, 75585, '<td valign="top">I was hoping this would have done better - it was a favorite for me.  Especially having two boys who love to fish.</td>', 'I was hoping this would have done better - it was a favorite for me.  Especially having two boys who love to fish.', '2010-04-08 19:43:15.000000', NULL, 0),
