(5939252, 861399, 33361, '<td valign="top">This is awesome!</td>', 'This is awesome!', '2010-04-10 08:02:59.000000', NULL, 0),
(5939341, 863917, 100301, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by glad2badad:</b></div><hr/><i> Hard to get any grasp of size/scale here.  Did you do anything color adjustments in post?  I ask because the sky seems kind of aqua blue/green to me.  Could be natural I suppose...  Anyway, good luck in the challenge. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>No color adjustment, it was just as the sun was breaking the horizon so it''s simply early morning light.</td>', 'Originally posted by glad2badad: Hard to get any grasp of size/scale here.  Did you do anything color adjustments in post?  I ask because the sky seems kind of aqua blue/green to me.  Could be natural I suppose...  Anyway, good luck in the challenge.   No color adjustment, it was just as the sun was breaking the horizon so it''s simply early morning light.', '2010-04-10 11:30:06.000000', NULL, 0),
(5939388, 863739, 106349, '<td valign="top">It''s funny... when I first saw this picture, before I scrolled down to the scores... I thought, I really really like this picture but I bet it didn''t score well.<br/> <br/>Not sure what voters are thinking some times. I think the creative artistic shots like this really score unfairly on here but I guess not everyone likes the artistic stuff.<br/> <br/>So, good job.</td>', 'It''s funny... when I first saw this picture, before I scrolled down to the scores... I thought, I really really like this picture but I bet it didn''t score well. Not sure what voters are thinking some times. I think the creative artistic shots like this really score unfairly on here but I guess not everyone likes the artistic stuff. So, good job.', '2010-04-10 12:51:01.000000', NULL, 0),
(5939453, 862926, 30861, '<td valign="top">This one just blew me away. I was one of the 8''s. It totally succeeds in one of photography''s great jobs; to draw attention, focus attention, to the bitter weirdness that is all around us. Well done, friend!</td>', 'This one just blew me away. I was one of the 8''s. It totally succeeds in one of photography''s great jobs; to draw attention, focus attention, to the bitter weirdness that is all around us. Well done, friend!', '2010-04-10 14:14:05.000000', NULL, 0),
(5939482, 863889, 86958, '<td valign="top">Excellent image. A well deserved ribbon. IMO it has all the qualities of a winning image - subject, technically well done, and emotion. I''m wondering what it would be like with her looking straight at the camera- just a thought.</td>', 'Excellent image. A well deserved ribbon. IMO it has all the qualities of a winning image - subject, technically well done, and emotion. I''m wondering what it would be like with her looking straight at the camera- just a thought.', '2010-04-10 14:53:31.000000', NULL, 0),
(5939629, 862926, 37845, '<td valign="top">I cant say how relieved I am to see that this photo was journalistic. I''m glad I didn''t vote though, because if I had, my anger and disgust at the scene would have affected my vote. <br/> <br/>This is a brilliant photo in that is inspired more emotion than any other photo I have seen on this site. Well done. <br/> <br/>Now.... I just wish childrens aid could get a hold of this little guy, and take him away from his parents''/guardians'' stupidity.</td>', 'I cant say how relieved I am to see that this photo was journalistic. I''m glad I didn''t vote though, because if I had, my anger and disgust at the scene would have affected my vote.  This is a brilliant photo in that is inspired more emotion than any other photo I have seen on this site. Well done.  Now.... I just wish childrens aid could get a hold of this little guy, and take him away from his parents''/guardians'' stupidity.', '2010-04-10 19:57:33.000000', NULL, 0),
(5939883, 861576, 14986, '<td valign="top">Wow. I think I would have had to change my pants after this before getting back in the car.  You are a crazy, excellent photographer.  Congrats on the well-deserved blue ribbon, and most importantly THE shot.</td>', 'Wow. I think I would have had to change my pants after this before getting back in the car.  You are a crazy, excellent photographer.  Congrats on the well-deserved blue ribbon, and most importantly THE shot.', '2010-04-11 02:01:52.000000', NULL, 0),
(5939888, 863889, 14986, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot.</td>', 'Beautiful shot.', '2010-04-11 02:04:53.000000', NULL, 0),
(5940138, 862004, 109341, '<td valign="top"><br/>Very nice! Congrats!</td>', 'Very nice! Congrats!', '2010-04-11 11:03:51.000000', NULL, 0),
(5940205, 861576, 115034, '<td valign="top">WOOOOOOOOW</td>', 'WOOOOOOOOW', '2010-04-11 12:38:40.000000', NULL, 0),
(5940575, 863364, 554, '<td valign="top">I agree, this should have placed much higher.</td>', 'I agree, this should have placed much higher.', '2010-04-11 20:51:10.000000', NULL, 0),
