(6109769, 864390, 40718, '<td valign="top">I studied this one for a while trying to figure out how to improve it.  Shots like this can really shine, but they do seem to be very sky dependent.  So the sky here does let us down (although it''s not as homogenous as your other building shot "Glass and Steel").  The colors here also don''t add and that always makes me think B&amp;W.  Your composition is probably just fine.  I''ll offer two shots to compare to.  Compositionally both are similar to this (actually bspurgeon''s is probably better than both of ours).  Compare and come away with your own conclusions.<br/> <br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=831220" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/1000-1999/1116/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_831220.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/1000-1999/1116/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_831220.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/1000-1999/1116/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_831220.jpg"/></a> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=325091" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/0-999/485/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_325091.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/0-999/485/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_325091.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/0-999/485/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_325091.jpg"/></a><br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2010-07-30 17:37:52.</i></td>', 'I studied this one for a while trying to figure out how to improve it.  Shots like this can really shine, but they do seem to be very sky dependent.  So the sky here does let us down (although it''s not as homogenous as your other building shot "Glass and Steel").  The colors here also don''t add and that always makes me think B&W.  Your composition is probably just fine.  I''ll offer two shots to compare to.  Compositionally both are similar to this (actually bspurgeon''s is probably better than both of ours).  Compare and come away with your own conclusions.  ', '2010-07-30 18:37:28.000000', '2010-07-30 18:37:52.000000', 0),
