(6123873, 864142, 40718, '<td valign="top">A nice composition with leading lines of the road and telephone wires (I''m happy you left them in).  The lack of clouds is mildly too bad, although you don''t always have to have clouds to pull a landscape off.  I think you just pumped the blues too high.  Blue and orange are classic contrasting colors, but here they look a bit comic and the snow looks like some blueberry meringue.</td>', 'A nice composition with leading lines of the road and telephone wires (I''m happy you left them in).  The lack of clouds is mildly too bad, although you don''t always have to have clouds to pull a landscape off.  I think you just pumped the blues too high.  Blue and orange are classic contrasting colors, but here they look a bit comic and the snow looks like some blueberry meringue.', '2010-08-08 23:21:39.000000', NULL, 0),
